		["Change a lighting property. Client-side, so a script that reasserts lighting will overwrite it."] = "修改光照属性。仅客户端生效，重新设置光照的脚本会覆盖它。",
		["Change master password"] = "更改主密码",
		["Change movement or health values on your own character. Values a server owns will snap back."] = "修改自己角色的移动或生命值。由服务器掌管的数值会被回滚。",
		["Change the camera's field of view, type, or position. Setting a position needs CameraType 'Scriptable' to stick."] = "修改相机的视野、类型或位置。设置位置需要 CameraType 为 'Scriptable' 才能保持。",
		["Change these"] = "修改这些",
		["Change this in Settings / Privacy. Other scripts sharing the executor can still intercept keys while they are in use."] = "可在 设置 / 隐私 中更改。共用执行器的其他脚本仍可能在密钥使用时拦截它们。",
		["Changes apply to this queued message. Attached images stay attached."] = "修改只作用于这条排队消息。已附加的图片会保留。",
		["Chat"] = "对话",
		["Chat loop stopped"] = "聊天循环已停止",
		["Chat loops"] = "聊天循环",
		["Chat loops & quiz scores"] = "聊天循环与测验得分",
		["Check Luau syntax without executing code or changing the game. Provide inline 'code' or a saved file 'path', not both. Prefer path for scripts you wrote or edited so their source need not be sent again. Returns compile errors for correction before run_luau."] = "检查 Luau 语法，不执行代码也不改动游戏。提供内联 'code' 或已保存文件的 'path'，二者只能选一。自己写过或改过的脚本优先用 path，避免再次发送源码。返回编译错误，便于在 run_luau 之前修正。",
		["Check performance"] = "检查性能",
		["Check subagents owned by this conversation. Omit id for compact statuses; give an exact id for current progress or its completed report. Reports and lists use bounded UTF-8 byte pages: follow nextOffset with offset until eof. Check after 2-3 work batches or about 15-30 seconds, while continuing independent work. When no independent work remains, wait_seconds=1-30 waits for a selected child to finish or the deadline; 0 returns immediately. Never tight-poll. Waiting does not stop the children."] = "查看本对话拥有的子代理。省略 id 获取简要状态；给出精确 id 获取当前进度或已完成报告。报告与列表使用有界 UTF-8 字节分页：用 offset 跟随 nextOffset 直到 eof。每 2–3 个工作批次或约 15–30 秒检查一次，同时继续独立工作。没有独立工作时，wait_seconds=1–30 可等待指定子代理完成或到达时限；0 立即返回。切勿高频轮询。等待不会停止子代理。",
		["Choice values, one per line"] = "可选项，每行一个",
		["Choose Auto, Send or Omit temperature for each model. Auto honors documented restrictions and learns explicit provider refusals without retrying ordinary range errors."] = "为每个模型选择「自动」「发送」或「不发送」温度。「自动」会遵循文档中的限制，并记住提供商的明确拒绝，而不会对普通的范围错误反复重试。",
		["Choose a folder for this conversation."] = "为此对话选择文件夹。",
		["Choose a hosted API or a local server. You'll review the connection before saving."] = "选择托管 API 或本地服务器。保存前会先检查连接。",
		["Choose a model"] = "选择模型",
		["Choose a model below"] = "在下方选择模型",
		["Choose a model first: fetch the list, or type the id."] = "请先选择模型：拉取列表，或直接输入 ID。",
		["Choose a name you recognize. Leave blank to use its number."] = "取一个好认的名字。留空则使用序号。",
		["Choose a recently verified free model for included HCNSEC access when its model is Auto. Off keeps provider Auto and stops new local routing probes; an active request continues."] = "当模型为 Auto 时，为内置 HCNSEC 访问挑选最近验证过的免费模型。关闭后保持提供商 Auto，并停止新的本地路由探测；进行中的请求继续运行。",
		["Choose an opt-in tool profile in Settings → Agent to declare a smaller catalogue. All tools remains the default; hidden tools stay callable through tool_search with their normal permissions and conversation scope."] = "在 设置 → 代理 中选择按需启用的工具档案，只声明更小的目录。「全部工具」仍是默认；隐藏工具仍可通过 tool_search 调用，权限与对话范围不变。",
		["Choose folder"] = "选择文件夹",
		["Choose how to support us"] = "选择支持我们的方式",
		["Choose password encryption or explicitly continue without it. Encryption and unlocking show a compact corner percentage, and password prompts fit their contents. The Claude Code Settings tab is now Project UAI."] = "选择密码加密，或明确选择不加密继续。加密与解锁只在角落显示紧凑百分比，密码弹窗按内容自适应。Claude Code 设置页更名为 Project UAI。",
		["Choose selected object / bookmark"] = "选择选中的对象 / 书签",
		["Choose where to keep this conversation."] = "选择此对话的存放位置。",
		["Choosing a card seeds the editor, which repeats the tier and description. The Preset row reopens the gallery without discarding a typed name, key or model, and a dismissed draft resumes on the next Add."] = "选择卡片会把内容填入编辑器，并重复显示档位与说明。「预设」一行可重新打开画廊，且不会丢掉已输入的名称、密钥或模型；被关掉的草稿会在下次「添加」时继续。",
		["Class (optional)"] = "类名（可选）",
		["Claude Code identity is required by AgentRouter and is always sent. It cannot be turned off for this endpoint."] = "AgentRouter 要求 Claude Code 身份标识，且始终发送，此端点无法关闭。",
		["Clear all traffic rules"] = "清除所有流量规则",
		["Clear conversation"] = "清空对话",
		["Clear evidence"] = "清除证据",
		["Clear memory?"] = "清除记忆？",
		["Clear queued"] = "清空队列",
		["Clear queued messages?"] = "清空排队消息？",
		["Clear retained calls"] = "清除已保留调用",
		["Clear retained calls?"] = "清除已保留调用？",
		["Clear saved rules"] = "清除已保存规则",
		["Clear search"] = "清除搜索",
		["Clear this conversation?"] = "清空此对话？",
		["Clear what is stored"] = "清除已存储内容",
		["Clearer conversations and reliable connections"] = "更清晰的对话与可靠的连接",
		["Click Start Cowork in UAI Bridge.exe. This script finds it on port 28791 and reconnects when the app restarts. No token copying is needed. Manual connections below take priority when enabled."] = "在 UAI Bridge.exe 中点击 Start Cowork。脚本会在 28791 端口找到它，并在应用重启后自动重连，无需复制令牌。启用后，下方的手动连接优先。",
		["Click a folder to expand · click a file to open"] = "点击文件夹展开 · 点击文件打开",
		["Click, hold, release or move the mouse at screen coordinates. Held buttons release on up, cancellation or unload. Unknown or partial input outcomes are reported without repeating clicks; retry only an explicit up after release failure."] = "在屏幕坐标处点击、长按、释放或移动鼠标。按住的按钮会在抬起、取消或卸载时释放。未知或部分输入结果会如实报告且不重复点击；仅在释放失败后重试明确的 up。",
		["Client, bridge, Windows app and Android companion now share version 3.6.5 in one release. Existing update flows retain their verified downloads and production identity."] = "客户端、桥接、Windows 应用与 Android 伴生端现在统一为 3.6.5，一次发布。既有更新流程仍保留经过校验的下载与正式身份。",
		["Cline uses your existing Cline profile through the connected desktop bridge and supports text only. Missing sign-in or a disconnected bridge gives a clear setup message. Its credentials stay on the desktop."] = "Cline 通过已连接的桌面桥接使用你现有的 Cline 配置，仅支持文本。未登录或桥接断开时会给出明确的配置提示。其凭据保留在桌面端。",
		["Clone an instance. The copy keeps its children."] = "克隆实例，副本保留其子项。",
		["Close script"] = "关闭脚本",
		["Code"] = "代码",
