		["Community key added to this draft. Choose a model and save to use it."] = "社区密钥已加入此草稿。选择模型并保存后即可使用。",
		["Compact"] = "紧凑",
		["Compact at"] = "压缩触发点",
		["Compact controls reserve enough room for larger text. Multiline fields adjust their padding without replacing the field, draft or selection when keyboard space changes."] = "紧凑控件会为更大文字预留空间。键盘空间变化时，多行字段只调整内边距，不会替换字段、草稿或选区。",
		["Compact input"] = "收起输入框",
		["Compact now"] = "立即压缩",
		["Compacted context: about %{before} to %{after} tokens."] = "上下文已压缩：约从 %{before} 降至 %{after} Token。",
		["Compacting context"] = "正在压缩上下文",
		["Compaction point: "] = "压缩点：",
		["Companion connected. Long replies are relayed through this phone."] = "伴生端已连接。长回复会经由这台手机中继。",
		["Companion message decoding"] = "伴生端消息解码",
		["Companion relay"] = "伴生中继",
		["Companion requests and deadlines"] = "伴生端请求与时限",
		["Compare source"] = "对比源码",
		["Compile saved source without executing it and return hashes, lexical outlines and structured diagnostics. Supply path for one file or manifest for project-wide syntax and literal require checks. Explicitly reports compiler availability; does NOT claim Luau type checking or Roblox API validation."] = "编译已保存的源码但不执行，返回哈希、词法大纲与结构化诊断。单个文件传 path，整个项目传 manifest，以进行语法与字面 require 检查。会明确报告编译器是否可用；不声称进行 Luau 类型检查或 Roblox API 校验。",
		["Compile/check a saved project and export one deterministic .lua bundle without running it. Module-local require resolves declared IDs only. Refuses output paths that overwrite project inputs. Existing output requires expected_hash; new output is created. Returns source line locations and a recovery checkpoint. Review inputs before building and output before tests."] = "编译/检查已保存的项目，并导出一个确定性的 .lua 单文件包，不运行它。模块内的 require 只解析已声明的 ID。拒绝会覆盖项目输入文件的输出路径。已有输出需要 expected_hash；新输出会直接创建。返回源码行位置与恢复检查点。构建前检查输入，测试前检查输出。",
		["Configuration imported for this session"] = "配置已导入（仅本次会话）",
		["Configure third-party inference"] = "配置第三方推理",
		["Connect a model"] = "连接模型",
		["Connect your external agent to Roblox with MCP, use the rebuilt bridge, and send follow-ups while UAI works. Free access learns compatible fast routes."] = "用 MCP 把外部代理接到 Roblox，使用重构后的桥接，并在 UAI 工作时发送追问。免费额度会学习兼容的快速线路。",
		["Connecting to Cowork automatically selects Web for live replies. Disconnecting returns new requests to Game. Tools and permissions stay in Roblox. Open the browser link to start chatting."] = "连接 Cowork 后会自动把实时回复切换到 Web；断开后新请求回到游戏内。工具与权限仍留在 Roblox。打开浏览器链接即可开始聊天。",
		["Connection and activity"] = "连接与活动",
		["Connection details"] = "连接详情",
		["Connection for "] = "连接 ",
		["Connectors"] = "连接器",
		["Context about %{percent}% full -- summarise older turns"] = "上下文已用约 %{percent}%——压缩较早的回合",
		["Context breakdown"] = "上下文构成",
		["Context budget"] = "上下文上限",
		["Context usage"] = "上下文用量",
		["Context window"] = "上下文窗口",
		["Continue a completed subagent with its existing context. Returns its id immediately by default; do independent work while it runs, check agent_status periodically and collect the new report. Use the id from dispatch_agent or agent_status. Set background=false only when this call must wait for the answer."] = "在保留上下文的前提下继续一个已完成的子代理。默认立即返回 id；它运行时做独立工作，定期查看 agent_status 并收集新报告。id 来自 dispatch_agent 或 agent_status。仅当必须等待答案时才设 background=false。",
		["Continue without encryption"] = "不加密继续",
		["Control Gravity using native handlers: start/recenter (defaults to your character), stop and release parts, pause/resume, enable/disable, reroll, reset_settings (all engine/shape settings and keybinds to defaults), or launch/charge a manually controlled Slingshot."] = "用原生处理器控制 Gravity：启动/回到中心（默认以你的角色为准）、停止并释放部件、暂停/恢复、启用/禁用、重新随机、reset_settings（把引擎/形状设置与键位恢复默认），或发射/蓄力手动控制的弹弓。",
		["Conversation and follow-ups"] = "对话与追问",
		["Conversation compacted."] = "对话已压缩。",
		["Conversation folders"] = "对话文件夹",
		["Conversation requests"] = "对话请求数",
		["Conversation title (optional)"] = "对话标题（可选）",
		["Conversations deleted"] = "对话已删除",
		["Conversations in this folder will move to Universal. Their messages will be kept."] = "此文件夹中的对话会移到 Universal，消息会保留。",
		["Conversations, activity history, workspace files, and skill files are not included. Saved memory and skill preferences are included."] = "不包含对话、活动历史、工作区文件与技能文件；已保存的记忆与技能偏好会包含在内。",
		["Coordinated apps"] = "各端同步",
		["Coordinating subagents"] = "正在协调子代理",
		["Copies and included access"] = "副本与内置额度",
		["Copy"] = "复制",
		["Copy address"] = "复制地址",
		["Copy an agent setup prompt from Settings → MCP. It includes the detected connection details and asks your agent to configure and verify its connection."] = "从 设置 → MCP 复制一段代理配置提示词，其中包含检测到的连接信息，并要求你的代理完成配置与验证。",
		["Copy config without credentials"] = "复制配置（不含凭据）",
		["Copy config · includes API keys"] = "复制配置 · 含 API 密钥",
		["Copy details"] = "复制详情",
		["Copy diagnostics"] = "复制诊断信息",
		["Copy endpoint"] = "复制端点",
		["Copy every saved setting to another device, including provider records, API keys and key pools, custom headers and parameters, permissions, and preferences. This JSON includes credentials; keep it private."] = "把全部已保存设置复制到另一台设备，包括提供商记录、API 密钥与密钥池、自定义请求头与参数、权限和偏好。该 JSON 含凭据，请勿外泄。",
		["Copy field name"] = "复制字段名",
		["Copy invite"] = "复制邀请链接",
		["Copy link"] = "复制链接",
		["Copy output"] = "复制输出",
		["Copy path"] = "复制路径",
		["Copy private config including credentials"] = "复制私有配置（含凭据）",
		["Copy source"] = "复制源码",
		["Copy source reference"] = "复制源码引用",
		["Copy start command"] = "复制启动命令",
		["Copy system prompt"] = "复制系统提示词",
		["Copy the destination object's reference from its More menu before moving."] = "移动前，先从目标对象的「更多」菜单复制其引用。",
		["Copy to clipboard"] = "复制到剪贴板",
		["Copy value"] = "复制值",
		["Core files, execution and instance tools only; the rest is one tool_search away."] = "仅核心文件、执行与实例工具；其余工具通过 tool_search 获取。",
		["Core plus Gravity, Infinite Yield, players, character and world tools."] = "核心工具，加上 Gravity、Infinite Yield、玩家、角色与世界工具。",
		["Core plus in-game chat and player tools."] = "核心工具，加上游戏内聊天与玩家工具。",
		["Core plus remotes, screen, diagnostics and web inspection."] = "核心工具，加上远程调用、屏幕、诊断与网页检查。",
		["Core plus the code workspace and interface tools."] = "核心工具，加上代码工作区与界面工具。",
		["Core plus the code workspace, interface and project tools."] = "核心工具，加上代码工作区、界面与项目工具。",
		["Could not compact right now."] = "当前无法压缩。",
		["Could not copy details"] = "无法复制详情",
		["Could not copy diagnostics"] = "无法复制诊断信息",
		["Could not copy this code"] = "无法复制这段代码",
		["Could not encode the export"] = "无法编码导出内容",
		["Could not finish: "] = "无法完成：",
		["Could not reach the clipboard"] = "无法访问剪贴板",
		["Could not save this change."] = "无法保存此修改。",
		["Could not start the teleport: "] = "无法启动传送：",
		["Could not write it: "] = "写入失败：",
		["Could not write the support bundle: "] = "无法写入支持包：",
		["Count instances by class under a subtree. Good for sizing up an unfamiliar place before walking it."] = "统计子树下各类实例数量。适合在遍历陌生场景前先摸清规模。",
		["Counted from what this client observed and kept on disk, so it survives a restart."] = "依据本客户端观测并落盘的数据统计，重启后仍然保留。",
		["Counts persist on this device from this update. Context breakdown explains the total; earlier untracked requests are not reconstructed."] = "计数自本次更新起在本机保留。上下文构成会解释总数；更早未统计的请求不会被回溯重建。",
		["Create a local, redacted support bundle from Diagnostics. It excludes API keys, memory, custom instructions, conversation text, file contents and captured payloads."] = "在「诊断」中生成一份本地脱敏支持包，不含 API 密钥、记忆、自定义指令、对话文本、文件内容与捕获载荷。",
		["Create a workspace file or replace most of its content (up to 2 MiB per call). Parent folders are created. For existing files, prefer file_edit or file_edit_many for targeted changes. Build large new scripts in small sections with sequential file_write then file_append calls."] = "创建 工作区文件或替换其大部分内容（每次最多 2 MiB）。会自动创建父文件夹。已有文件请优先用 file_edit 或 file_edit_many 做定点修改。大脚本请分段构建：先 file_write，再用 file_append 依次追加。",
		["Create an instance and parent it. Properties are applied after creation, in the order given."] = "创建实例并设置父级。属性在创建后按给定顺序应用。",
		["Create or conditionally replace shared source. Existing nonempty source requires expected_revision. Saves a recoverable checkpoint and never changes the user's selection."] = "创建或按条件替换共享源码。已存在的非空源码需要提供 expected_revision。会保存可恢复的检查点，且绝不改变用户的当前选择。",
		["Create or update a custom Infinite Yield .iy plugin. Get the template with iy_plugin_read. Source may declare shared locals/globals above local Plugin, and must return a table with PluginName, PluginDescription and Commands. Each command has ListName, Description, Aliases and Function(args, speaker). Prefer a saved path for long source. Checks syntax before saving. By default executes setup once, validates the returned table and loads/reloads it through IY, returning actual registered command names. load=false only saves syntax-checked source. Set overwrite=true to replace an existing file. Reloading replaces commands; plugin-owned event connections or loops need cleanup in the plugin's own setup/unload command."] = "创建或更新自定义 Infinite Yield .iy 插件。模板可用 iy_plugin_read 获取。源码可以在 local Plugin 之上声明共享局部变量/全局变量，并且必须返回包含 PluginName、PluginDescription 与 Commands 的表。每个命令包含 ListName、Description、Aliases 与 Function(args, speaker)。长源码请优先用已保存路径。保存前会检查语法。默认执行一次初始化、校验返回表并通过 IY 加载/重载，然后返回实际注册的命令名。load=false 只保存通过语法检查的源码。替换已有文件需设 overwrite=true。重载会替换命令；插件自己建立的事件连接或循环需要在插件自身的初始化/卸载命令中清理。",
		["Create something"] = "做点东西",
		["Create support bundle"] = "生成支持包",
		["Create/update a real GravityShapes/<plugin>.lua file from a saved source path or inline source. Prefer path for long scripts. Checks syntax and verifies disk contents. By default evaluates setup once with a deadline, validates f2/Controls and registers the module in Gravity. load=false saves without executing. overwrite=true is required for replacement. Does not select an inactive shape; existing active shapes reload with cleanup. Plugin callbacks need their own cleanup."] = "从已保存的源码路径或内联源码创建/更新真实的 GravityShapes/<plugin>.lua 文件。长脚本请优先用 path。会检查语法并核对磁盘内容。默认在时限内执行一次初始化，校验 f2/Controls 并把模块注册到 Gravity。load=false 只保存不执行。替换已有文件必须 overwrite=true。不会选中未激活的形状；已激活的形状会带清理地重新加载。插件回调需要自己负责清理。",
		["Credential storage"] = "凭据存储",
		["Credential vault"] = "凭据保险库",
