		["Don't show again"] = "不再显示",
		["Donate with Robux"] = "用 Robux 捐赠",
		["Donation options"] = "捐赠方式",
		["Download and run the official Project Gravity loader in this client, then report the live status. Use this when gravity_status shows Gravity is not loaded. If Gravity is already connected this reports that without reloading; pass force=true to re-run the loader, which reloads Gravity and releases held parts. This fetches and executes remote code from the Project Gravity repository."] = "在本客户端中下载并运行官方 Project Gravity 加载器，然后报告实时状态。当 gravity_status 显示 Gravity 未加载时使用。若已连接则只报告状态、不重新加载；传 force=true 可重新运行加载器，这会重新加载 Gravity 并释放已持有的部件。此操作会从 Project Gravity 仓库获取并执行远程代码。",
		["Download bridge files"] = "下载桥接文件",
		["Draws the Luau, the file body or the property map a tool call carries under its row, outside the fold. Off, it is still there behind the row's own caret."] = "在工具行下方（折叠之外）绘制它携带的 Luau、文件内容或属性表。关闭后仍可在该行的展开箭头里找到。",
		["Duplicate credential copies"] = "重复的凭据副本",
		-- e
		["Each key shows locally recorded requests and input/output tokens, with estimates marked. Renaming or pausing keeps its usage; replacing the credential starts fresh."] = "每把密钥显示本机记录的请求数与输入/输出 Token，估算值会标注。改名或暂停会保留用量；替换凭据则重新开始统计。",
		["Each of these is immediate and cannot be undone."] = "以下操作立即生效，且无法撤销。",
		["Each response has one heading and an uninterrupted answer. Tools, thinking and delegated work are grouped into a collapsed activity drawer; approvals and failures stay visible."] = "每条回复只有一个标题和一段不被打断的答案。工具、思考与委派工作被收进折叠的活动抽屉；审批与失败仍然可见。",
		["Earlier matching calls"] = "更早的匹配调用",
