		["Exact text (Next repeats the search)"] = "精确文本（「下一个」继续搜索）",
		["Excerpt"] = "节选",
		["Existing desktop 3.6.0 automatically fetches bridge 3.6.1 and its web files when idle. Refresh the browser and reload the published Roblox client for the complete fix."] = "现有的桌面端 3.6.0 会在空闲时自动获取 bridge 3.6.1 及其网页文件。刷新浏览器并重新加载已发布的 Roblox 客户端即可获得完整修复。",
		["Expand input"] = "展开输入框",
		["Expand output"] = "展开输出",
		["Expand tool detail"] = "展开工具详情",
		["Expanded thinking on touch-only devices draws a bounded excerpt while retaining the original reasoning in conversation context and saved history."] = "纯触屏设备上展开思考时，只绘制有界摘要，同时在对话上下文与历史记录中保留完整推理。",
		["Explicit Run only. Inputs are available as local inputs = ..."] = "仅在显式运行时提供。输入可通过 local inputs = ... 获取",
		["Explicit deadlines, Stop and provider failures still end the original request. Lost polls keep the same request ID and never start a second inference."] = "显式截止时间、停止与提供商失败仍会结束原始请求。轮询丢失时沿用同一请求 ID，绝不会再发起第二次推理。",
		["Explore this game"] = "探索这个游戏",
		["Explore, create, or diagnose"] = "浏览、创建或诊断",
		["Explorer selection"] = "资源管理器选中项",
		["Export failed"] = "导出失败",
		["Export retained calls"] = "导出已保留调用",
		["Export source"] = "导出源码",
		["Export to a file"] = "导出到文件",
		["Exported "] = "已导出 ",
		["Extract editable copy / selection"] = "提取可编辑副本 / 选区",
		["Extract selection / page into script"] = "将选区 / 本页提取为脚本",
		-- f
		["Failed storage updates keep live keys and report the failure. Unreadable encoded records are preserved and cannot silently become anonymous requests. Older exports and backups remain under your control and may still contain plaintext credentials."] = "存储更新失败会保留正在使用的密钥并报告失败。无法读取的编码记录会被保留，不会悄悄变成匿名请求。更早的导出与备份仍由你保管，其中可能仍含明文凭据。",
		["Fallback order"] = "回退顺序",
		["Favorite model"] = "常用模型",
		["Fetch a web page as readable text or JSON. Returns contiguous UTF-8 pages: continue with page_id and offset without downloading it again. Snapshots last five minutes; four pages / 4 MiB retained. Reading does not execute page scripts."] = "以可读文本或 JSON 获取网页。返回连续的 UTF-8 分页：用 page_id 与 offset 继续，无需重新下载。快照保留五分钟；最多保留四页 / 4 MiB。读取不会执行页面脚本。",
		["Fetch catalog"] = "获取目录",
		["Fetch from /models"] = "从 /models 获取",
		["Fetching models from "] = "正在从以下地址拉取模型：",
		["File under "] = "文件位于 ",
		["File under workspace files (optional)"] = "工作区文件中的路径（可选）",
		["Filter field names or values"] = "过滤字段名或值",
		["Filter loaded files"] = "过滤已加载文件",
		["Filter retained calls without changing what the capture records."] = "过滤已保留的调用，不改变捕获记录的内容。",
		["Find desktop app automatically"] = "自动查找桌面端",
		["Find free models by their rounded green outlines in both Roblox and the bridge."] = "在 Roblox 与桥接中，用圆角绿色描边即可认出免费模型。",
		["Find in this file"] = "在此文件中查找",
		["Find installed native CLI files behind npm and Bun launchers, in common Windows installation folders and macOS app resources. Quoted PATH entries and active nvm installations are supported."] = "能在 npm 与 Bun 启动器背后、常见 Windows 安装目录与 macOS 应用资源中找到已安装的原生 CLI 文件。支持带引号的 PATH 项与活动的 nvm 安装。",
		["Find instances and read selected properties/attributes in one call. Name is a case-insensitive substring; class uses IsA. Stops as soon as a page fills, without collecting the entire subtree. Search is capped at 20,000 nodes."] = "一次调用中查找实例并读取选定的属性/特性。名称是大小写不敏感的子串；类名使用 IsA。填满一页即停止，不收集整棵子树。搜索上限 20,000 个节点。",
		["Find literal text in a known file or directory before reading relevant slices with file_read_many. Returns reusable files/ paths, matching lines, byte offsets and a continuation cursor. Searches subfolders; skips binary/files over 2 MB. Narrow path to the current game or known source directory to avoid unrelated games/dumps."] = "在已知文件或目录中查找字面文本，再用 file_read_many 读取相关片段。返回可复用的 files/ 路径、匹配行、字节偏移与续读游标。会搜索子目录；跳过二进制文件与超过 2 MB 的文件。把 path 收窄到当前游戏或已知源码目录，避免搜到无关游戏与导出内容。",
		["Find providers and models faster, use AgentRouter's supported GPT models, and manage desktop tunnels in one place. Tools, logs and usage history are clearer across the coordinated 3.7.0 apps."] = "更快找到提供商与模型，使用 AgentRouter 支持的 GPT 模型，并集中管理桌面隧道。3.7.0 各端同步后，工具、日志与用量历史更清晰。",
		["Find remotes in the place, with how many client-side listeners each has when the host can tell."] = "查找场景中的远程调用，并在宿主可判断时给出每个的客户端监听数。",
		["Find text"] = "查找文本",
		["Find tools hidden by the active tool profile. action=list returns names and one-line descriptions; action=describe returns a tool's exact schema pages; action=call runs that tool with its declared arguments. Hidden tools keep their normal permissions and conversation scope. Core tools are already declared; use this only when the needed tool is absent."] = "查找被当前工具档案隐藏的工具。action=list 返回名称与一行说明；action=describe 返回工具的完整 schema 分页；action=call 以声明的参数运行该工具。隐藏工具保持原有权限与对话范围。核心工具已声明，仅在缺少所需工具时使用。",
		["Find workspace or saved-paste files by filename glob without reading their contents. Use when you know a name or extension; returns sorted reusable paths and offset pages. Searches subfolders within bounded inventory; incomplete results are explicit. Narrow path to the current game or known source directory."] = "按文件名通配查找工作区或已保存粘贴的文件，不读取其内容。已知名称或扩展名时使用；返回排序后的可复用路径与分页偏移。会在有界清单内搜索子目录，结果不完整时会明确说明。请把 path 收窄到当前游戏或已知源码目录。",
		["Find your bearings in the world."] = "先弄清楚这个世界的结构。",
		["Find your way around"] = "熟悉界面",
		["Find · Ctrl+F"] = "查找 · Ctrl+F",
		["Finite request timeouts use integer seconds so the Android relay accepts them. Updated clients and companions can keep normal inference running beyond five minutes while each executor poll stays within five seconds."] = "有限请求超时使用整数秒，以便 Android 中继接受。更新后的客户端与伴生端可让正常推理持续超过五分钟，同时每次执行器轮询保持在五秒内。",
		["Fire a RemoteEvent to the server. This is a real server call: it can change the game and can be logged or punished by anticheat. Prefix an argument with a type when it is not a plain string or number, e.g. 'vec3:0, 10, 0' or 'instance:Workspace.Door'."] = "向服务器触发 RemoteEvent。这是真实的服务器调用：可能改变游戏，也可能被反作弊记录或惩罚。参数不是普通字符串或数字时请加类型前缀，例如 'vec3:0, 10, 0' 或 'instance:Workspace.Door'。",
		["First setup offers password encryption or a red Continue without encryption option. The unprotected choice is saved and skips future password prompts. Encrypted vaults still require their password on every execution; existing keys and pool settings carry over after verified storage."] = "首次设置提供密码加密，或红色的「不加密继续」。选择不加密会被保存，之后不再询问密码。加密保险库在每次执行时仍需输入密码；存储校验通过后，现有密钥与密钥池设置会保留。",
		["Fix companion request admission and deadline handling, show real connection activity, and add verified automatic Android update downloads."] = "修复伴生端的请求接入与截止时间处理，显示真实的连接活动，并新增经过校验的 Android 自动更新下载。",
		["Folder name"] = "文件夹名称",
		["Follow delegated work in one place. Open Details for live progress, messages, reports and follow-ups."] = "在一个地方跟进被委派的工作。打开「详情」查看实时进度、消息、报告与追问。",
		["Follow the work, inspect its output, and continue the same context."] = "跟进任务、查看输出，并在同一上下文中继续。",
		["Follow-ups run in this order after the current response or tool batch. Your draft stays in the composer, and the active turn is never interrupted."] = "追问会按此顺序在当前回复或工具批次之后执行。草稿仍留在输入框，当前回合不会被打断。",
		["Follow-ups run in this order after the current response or tool batch. Your draft stays in the composer, and the active turn keeps running."] = "追问会按此顺序在当前回复或工具批次之后执行。草稿仍留在输入框，当前回合继续运行。",
		["Follow-ups while working"] = "工作时的追问",
		["Forget everything"] = "忘记全部",
		["Forgot password? Remove saved credentials"] = "忘记密码？移除已保存凭据",
		["Free access is included. Join our Discord for updates, availability notices and help."] = "已内置免费额度。加入我们的 Discord 获取更新、可用性通知与帮助。",
		["Free models only"] = "仅免费模型",
		["Free only"] = "仅免费",
		["Free routes need no card. Paid routes need a key or credit. Local servers run on your machine. Pick any of them and every field stays editable."] = "免费线路无需银行卡；付费线路需要密钥或余额；本地服务器运行在你自己的机器上。任选一种，所有字段都仍可编辑。",
		["Full configuration"] = "完整配置",
		["Full configuration copied, including API keys"] = "完整配置已复制（含 API 密钥）",
		["Full configuration imported and saved"] = "完整配置已导入并保存",
		-- g
		["GET JSON and read a field by dotted path or exact keys (including keys containing dots). Large values retain a reference for http_result_read; false is a valid value and HTTP errors fail."] = "GET 一个 JSON，并按点分路径或精确键读取字段（包括含点号的键）。大值会保留引用供 http_result_read 读取；false 是合法值，HTTP 错误会使调用失败。",
		["GET a URL. HTTP errors fail the call. Large bodies retain a five-minute result reference for http_result_read without another request."] = "对 URL 发起 GET。HTTP 错误会使调用失败。大响应体会保留五分钟的结果引用，可用 http_result_read 读取而无需再次请求。",
		["Game changes"] = "游戏内变更",
		["Game roots"] = "游戏根节点",
		["Game runtime"] = "游戏内运行时",
		["Gateway socket URL"] = "网关 socket 地址",
		["Gemini and temperature controls"] = "Gemini 与温度控制",
		["General"] = "常规",
		["Get Project UAI updates, ask for help, and share what you build."] = "获取 Project UAI 更新、寻求帮助，分享你做的东西。",
		["Get updates, ask for help, and share what you build."] = "获取更新、寻求帮助，分享你做的东西。",
		["Getting started"] = "新手指引",
		["Go to line…"] = "跳转到行…",
		-- h
		["Hard ceiling on tokens kept before older turns are summarised. When the model's context window is known, compaction begins at the Compact-at fraction of it, so this mainly caps models with very large or unknown windows."] = "保留 Token 的硬上限，超过后较早的回合会被汇总。已知模型上下文窗口时，压缩从该窗口的「压缩触发点」比例开始，因此这一项主要约束窗口极大或未知的模型。",
		["Hidden"] = "隐藏",
		["Hidden loads Infinite Yield with its interface parked, so the agent has every command and you keep the screen. With GUI loads it untouched. Either way the agent reaches everything through the same dispatcher, and iy_cmd calls still pass the permission prompt. If Infinite Yield is already running when a command is sent, that copy is used as-is."] = "「隐藏」会在不显示界面的情况下加载 Infinite Yield，让代理拿到全部命令，同时不占你的屏幕；「显示界面」则原样加载。两种方式下，代理都通过同一个调度器访问全部命令，iy_cmd 调用同样会走权限确认。如果发送命令时 Infinite Yield 已在运行，则直接使用那一份。",
		["Hide context details"] = "隐藏上下文详情",
		["Home"] = "主页",
		["Honor provider instructions not to retry a terminal refusal. Shared connections still have provider allowances, so recovery cannot guarantee unlimited requests."] = "尊重提供商关于「终局拒绝不重试」的说明。共享连接仍受提供商配额限制，因此恢复无法保证无限请求。",
		["Host a quiz in Roblox chat: ask questions, detect the first correct player answer, keep scores, reveal unanswered answers, and repeat. Supply questions and answers. Returns a managed loop ID."] = "在 Roblox 聊天中主持测验：提问、判定首位答对的玩家、计分、公布无人答出的答案并重复。需提供题目与答案。返回受管理的循环 ID。",
		["How a fenced code block is drawn, in the transcript and everywhere else. Press one to use it."] = "围栏代码块的呈现方式，适用于对话与其他所有位置。点击即可选用。",
		["How many levels of subagent are allowed. A subagent given the full tool set can dispatch its own; at 0 the agent cannot dispatch at all and does the work in the conversation instead. The Subagents panel lists what is running under these limits."] = "允许的子代理层级。拿到完整工具集的子代理还能继续派发；设为 0 时完全不能派发，改为在对话里自己完成。子代理面板会列出这些限制下正在运行的任务。",
		["How to use your keys"] = "如何使用你的密钥",
		["Hybrid services are recommended and labelled by their free half: Free models for OpenCode Zen and OpenRouter, Free CLI for OpenCode Go. Included marks the distributed community key, Free tier and No key describe the other free routes, and no hybrid is labelled Paid."] = "混合服务被推荐时按其免费部分标注：OpenCode Zen 与 OpenRouter 标为「免费模型」，OpenCode Go 标为「免费 CLI」。「内置」标记分发的社区密钥，「免费层」「免密钥」描述其他免费线路，没有任何混合服务被标成「付费」。",
		-- i
		["INFERENCE PROVIDERS"] = "推理提供商",
		["Identify the current place: name, IDs, creator, live player counts and uptime. Product metadata is cached for 60 seconds; refresh=true bypasses it."] = "识别当前场景：名称、ID、创作者、在线玩家数与运行时长。产品元数据缓存 60 秒；refresh=true 可绕过。",
		["Ignore the step limit and the fifteen-minute turn deadline, and keep calling tools until the answer is written. The repeat breaker, each tool's own timeout and Stop still apply, and subagents keep their own budgets."] = "忽略步数上限与 15 分钟回合时限，持续调用工具直到写出答案。重复检测、各工具自身的超时和「停止」仍然生效，子代理保留各自的预算。",
		["Import & export"] = "导入与导出",
		["Import configuration"] = "导入配置",
		["Import from a file"] = "从文件导入",
		["Import full configuration"] = "导入完整配置",
		["Import offline capture…"] = "导入离线捕获…",
		["Import settings"] = "导入设置",
		["Included HCNSEC access measures small synthetic tool requests and prefers compatible fast models, targeting requests under ten seconds. Unknown or incompatible routes retain provider auto; your messages are never raced to benchmark models."] = "内置的 HCNSEC 访问会测量小型合成的工具请求，并优先选择兼容的快速模型，目标是把请求控制在十秒内。未知或不兼容的线路保持提供商 auto；你的消息绝不会被拿去和基准模型赛跑。",
		["Includes the verified OpenCode execution gate from bridge 3.6.2. Desktop tool selections return blocked-action feedback so the Roblox conversation can continue with available tools."] = "包含来自 bridge 3.6.2 的经验证的 OpenCode 执行闸门。桌面端工具选择会返回「动作被阻止」的反馈，让 Roblox 中的对话可以用现有工具继续。",
		["Incoming and outgoing"] = "入站与出站",
		["Incoming events"] = "入站事件",
		["Individual API keys"] = "独立 API 密钥",
		["Infinite Yield"] = "Infinite Yield",
		["Info"] = "信息",
		["Input key"] = "输入键名",
		["Inspect / edit source snapshot"] = "查看 / 编辑源码快照",
		["Inspect and configure Infinite Yield's saved events, keybinds, aliases, waypoints and settings. Inspect first for current 1-based binding indexes, event fields and defaults. Supports OnExecute, OnSpawn, OnDied, OnDamage, OnKilled, OnJoin, OnLeave and OnChatted. Event commands can use $1/$2 arguments; native IY ignores commands containing 'plugin'. Edits refresh IY's editor and request its normal save. Waypoints default to the current place. Use iy_cmd to execute commands, iy_plugin_write for plugins/custom events. stop_loops sends breakloops."] = "查看并配置 Infinite Yield 已保存的事件、键位、别名、路径点与设置。请先查看当前的绑定序号（从 1 开始）、事件字段与默认值。支持 OnExecute、OnSpawn、OnDied、OnDamage、OnKilled、OnJoin、OnLeave 与 OnChatted。事件命令可用 $1/$2 参数；原生 IY 会忽略包含 'plugin' 的命令。修改会刷新 IY 编辑器并请求其常规保存。路径点默认使用当前场景。执行命令用 iy_cmd，插件/自定义事件用 iy_plugin_write。stop_loops 会发送 breakloops。",
		["Inspect held Gravity parts with stable session-scoped IDs, paths, positions, selections and overrides. Paginated and sorted by claim ID; read nextOffset for more. IDs expire when the part is released or Gravity reloads."] = "查看 Gravity 持有的部件：会话内稳定的 ID、路径、位置、选中状态与覆盖项。按持有的 ID 分页排序；读 nextOffset 获取更多。部件被释放或 Gravity 重新加载后 ID 失效。",
		["Inspect my character"] = "检查我的角色",
		["Inspect retained value"] = "查看保留的值",
		["Inspect the connected Project Gravity engine, selected shape, targets, held part count and settings. Reports when Gravity is not loaded."] = "查看已连接的 Project Gravity 引擎、当前形状、目标、持有部件数与设置。未加载时如实报告。",
		["Inspect up to 20 known instance paths at once. Select only the properties and attributes needed; compact class defaults are used otherwise. Missing paths do not discard successful reads."] = "一次查看最多 20 个已知实例路径。只选择需要的属性与特性；否则使用紧凑的类默认值。缺失路径不会丢弃成功读取的部分。",
		["Inspect value"] = "查看值",
		["Install Node.js 18+ on this computer. Download the files, then open a terminal in your executor workspace (the folder containing UAI). Run: node UAI/bridge/start.txt"] = "在此电脑上安装 Node.js 18+。下载文件后，在执行器工作区（包含 UAI 的文件夹）打开终端，运行：node UAI/bridge/start.txt",
		["Install a plugin from the Infinite Yield store: downloads its .iy file, saves it to the workspace and registers it with the running Infinite Yield, whose commands then work through iy_cmd. Accepts the plugin name ('dexrecontinued'), a filename ('dexrecontinued.iy') or the store id."] = "从 Infinite Yield 商店安装插件：下载其 .iy 文件、保存到工作区并注册到正在运行的 Infinite Yield，之后即可通过 iy_cmd 使用其命令。接受插件名（'dexrecontinued'）、文件名（'dexrecontinued.iy'）或商店 id。",
		["Install a skill from GitHub: give owner/repo (e.g. 'DietrichGebert/ponytail'), a github.com URL, or a raw.githubusercontent.com URL. The .md is fetched, given proper frontmatter if it lacks it, and saved into skills/."] = "从 GitHub 安装技能：提供 owner/repo（例如 'DietrichGebert/ponytail'）、github.com 链接或 raw.githubusercontent.com 链接。会获取该 .md，缺少 frontmatter 时补上规范格式，然后保存到 skills/。",
		["Install the matching 3.6.0 companion and desktop releases. Production Android updates preserve the existing signing identity and pairing."] = "请安装匹配的 3.6.0 伴生端与桌面端。正式 Android 更新会保留原有签名身份与配对。",
		["Install update"] = "安装更新",
		["Install updates after active requests and retained replies finish. Android asks for installation approval; an interrupted installation retains its admission pause until resolved."] = "在活动请求与保留的回复都结束后再安装更新。Android 会请求安装授权；安装被中断时，准入暂停会一直保留到问题解决。",
		["Interface font"] = "界面字体",
		["Invalid encodings give clear guidance without exposing message contents. Resetting pairing is not a remedy for a message-decoding failure."] = "无效编码会给出明确指引，且不暴露消息内容。重置配对并不能解决消息解码失败。",
		["Invoke a RemoteFunction and return what the server answers. Blocks until it replies, and can hang if the server never does."] = "调用 RemoteFunction 并返回服务器答复。会阻塞直到回复；服务器不回复时可能一直挂起。",
		["Item name"] = "枚举项名称",
		["Its endpoint, key, model and health are all edited here."] = "其端点、密钥、模型与健康状态都在此处编辑。",
		-- j
		["Join Discord"] = "加入 Discord",
		["Join our Discord"] = "加入我们的 Discord",
		["Join our Discord for a tutorial on fixing this"] = "加入我们的 Discord 查看解决此问题的教程",
		["Join the Project UAI community"] = "加入 Project UAI 社区",
		["Join the community"] = "加入社区",
		["Joining is optional. Reminders appear at most once every two weeks and stop after you copy the invite."] = "加入完全自愿。提醒最多每两周出现一次，复制邀请后不再提醒。",
		["Jump to latest"] = "跳到最新",
		-- k
		["Keep chats in a game, Universal, or a folder you name."] = "把对话留在某个游戏、Universal，或你命名的文件夹里。",
		["Keep the included free access, or connect your own provider for a different model or more capacity."] = "沿用内置免费额度，或接入自己的提供商以使用其他模型、获得更高容量。",
		["Keep the panel list open"] = "保持面板列表展开",
		["Keep this password safe and back up your provider keys. Reset does not revoke keys at your providers or erase existing backups."] = "请妥善保管密码并备份提供商密钥。重置不会在提供商处吊销密钥，也不会抹除已有备份。",
		["Keeps a long conversation inside the context budget."] = "让长对话保持在上下文预算内。",
		["Key type"] = "键类型",
		["Keypoint "] = "关键点 ",
		["Keys and compact layouts"] = "密钥与紧凑布局",
		["Keys and logs"] = "密钥与日志",
		["Keys for this provider are issued at the address above."] = "该提供商的密钥需在上述地址申请。",
		["Kilo and OVHcloud no longer send the Claude Code identity: a public no-key gateway is not a Claude endpoint and never asked to be treated as one."] = "Kilo 与 OVHcloud 不再发送 Claude Code 身份标识：公开的免密钥网关不是 Claude 端点，也从未要求被当作 Claude 端点对待。",
		["Kilo recovery"] = "Kilo 恢复",
		["Kilo recovery is enabled by default in the Windows and Android apps and starts only after an explicit anonymous quota refusal. The original request stays within its deadline and can be stopped."] = "Windows 与 Android 应用默认启用 Kilo 恢复，只有在明确的匿名配额拒绝后才启动。原始请求仍受其时限约束，并且可以停止。",
		["Known cost estimate"] = "已知费用估算",
		["Ko-fi copies its link, which you can open in a browser."] = "Ko-fi 会复制链接，你可以用浏览器打开。",
		["Ko-fi link copied"] = "Ko-fi 链接已复制",
		-- l
		["Language"] = "语言",
		["Large keeps only results at or above 8 KiB for later recovery; source and file tools are already durable. All keeps every result; Off writes nothing."] = "「大型」只保留 8 KiB 及以上的结果以便回查；源码与文件工具本身已持久化。「全部」保留所有结果；「关闭」不写入任何内容。",
		["Large results (8 KiB+)"] = "大型结果（8 KiB+）",
		["Latest run"] = "最近一次运行",
		["Launch a background subagent that watches Roblox chat and answers players in real time using the active provider. It keeps its own conversation context and read-only game tools (instances, players, environment, chat history), so it can check the place before answering. It batches rapid messages, ignores self/system echoes and tagged bots, suppresses duplicate inputs and repeated replies, and adds a reply prefix. Do not also reply with chat_send. Stop or inspect it through chat_loop_stop/chat_loop_status."] = "启动一个后台子代理，监听 Roblox 聊天并用当前提供商实时回答玩家。它有自己的对话上下文与只读游戏工具（实例、玩家、环境、聊天历史），因此可以先查看场景再回答。它会合并密集消息、忽略自己/系统回声与带标签的机器人、抑制重复输入与重复回复，并加上回复前缀。不要再通过 chat_send 回复。用 chat_loop_stop/chat_loop_status 停止或查看。",
		["Launcher reset"] = "启动按钮已重置",
		["Layout"] = "布局",
		["Layout follows the viewport by default. Pin it if you would rather it did not."] = "布局默认跟随视口变化。若想固定，可在此锁定。",
		["Let a dispatched subagent run with no step limit or clock while its parent continues working. The repeat breaker, each tool's timeout, the ceilings below and Stop still apply. The Subagents panel can stop one child, and ending the parent turn stops unfinished children."] = "让已派发的子代理不受步数与时间限制，同时父级继续工作。重复检测、各工具超时、下方各项上限和「停止」仍然生效。子代理面板可停止单个子代理，结束父回合会停止未完成的子代理。",
		["Line number"] = "行号",
		["Link copied"] = "链接已复制",
		["List Infinite Yield commands, optionally filtered by a keyword or limited to one plugin's commands. Shows names, aliases, plugin origin, and argument signatures and descriptions when IY exposes them. Use it before iy_cmd to check syntax."] = "列出 Infinite Yield 命令，可按关键词过滤或只看某个插件的命令。会显示名称、别名、插件来源，以及 IY 暴露的参数签名与说明。执行 iy_cmd 前先用它确认写法。",
		["List files in a workspace directory. Returned files/ paths can be used unchanged with every file tool. Start with the current game path from the environment; omit path for all games."] = "列出工作区目录中的文件。返回的 files/ 路径可直接用于所有文件工具。先从环境给出的当前游戏路径开始；省略 path 表示所有游戏。",
		["List instances carrying a CollectionService tag, or list every tag in use."] = "列出带有某个 CollectionService 标签的实例，或列出所有在用的标签。",
		["List managed chat loops and chat agents, progress, failures, and quiz scores."] = "列出受管理的聊天循环与聊天代理、进度、失败与测验得分。",
		["List managed chat loops and independent chatbots, progress, failures, and quiz scores."] = "列出受管理的聊天循环与独立聊天机器人、进度、失败与测验得分。",
		["List script instances in the place, with their paths. Useful for finding where behaviour lives before reading it."] = "列出场景中的脚本实例及其路径。适合在阅读前定位行为所在。",
		["List the installed markdown skills (playbooks) with their one-line descriptions and whether each is enabled. A bounded enabled index appears in the environment; use this for omitted entries or to refresh the inventory, including switched-off ones. Filter by name/filename/description with query to find relevant guidance. Follow continuation offsets to see every entry."] = "列出已安装的 markdown 技能（操作手册）、各自的一行说明以及是否启用。环境中会出现有界启用索引；完整清单或被省略的条目（包括已关闭的）用这个工具查看。可用 query 按名称/文件名/说明过滤以找到相关指引。按续读偏移查看每个条目。",
		["List the live Gravity shape catalog, or pass name to inspect a shape's real control keys, values, buttons and stored-unit slider ranges. No hardcoded catalog."] = "列出实时的 Gravity 形状目录，或传入 name 查看某个形状的真实控制键、取值、按钮与存储单位滑块范围。目录不是硬编码的。",
		["List the ready-made script templates this client ships with. A template is a pre-written tool invocation for a common job -- player distances, ESP, FPS statistics, remote automation. Call with no arguments for the index; pass an id for one template's full detail."] = "列出本客户端内置的现成脚本模板。模板是针对常见任务的预写工具调用——玩家距离、ESP、FPS 统计、远程自动化。无参数调用获取索引；传 id 获取某个模板的完整详情。",
		["List the shared Code library, live document revisions, and open/active IDs. Source is read separately."] = "列出共享代码库、活动文档的修订版本，以及已打开/当前活动的 ID。源码需另行读取。",
		["List this user's other conversations for review, most recent first, each with its id, title, place, age, size and opening request. Use it to triage which past thread is relevant, then read that one with conversation_read. Untouched empty chats are omitted; the current conversation is marked and does not need reading. Query filters on the title or the opening request."] = "列出该用户的其他对话以便回顾，最近优先，含 id、标题、场景、时间、大小与开场请求。用于判断哪条线索相关，再用 conversation_read 读取。空对话会被省略；当前对话会被标记且无需读取。查询按标题或开场请求过滤。",
		["Listen to a RemoteEvent and report the next few things the server sends through it. Useful for learning a remote's argument shape before firing it."] = "监听 RemoteEvent，并报告服务器接下来通过它发送的几条内容。适合在触发前了解参数形态。",
		["Listen to any instance signal for a short window and report what fired, with argument shapes. Unlike remote_watch this works on ordinary RBXScriptSignals -- Touched, Changed, ChildAdded, MouseButton1Click -- so a game's wiring can be understood without firing anything at the server."] = "在短时间窗口内监听任意实例信号，并报告触发情况与参数形态。与 remote_watch 不同，它适用于普通 RBXScriptSignal——Touched、Changed、ChildAdded、MouseButton1Click——因此无需向服务器发任何东西就能理解游戏的接线方式。",
		["Live bridge previews and interface fixes"] = "实时桥接预览与界面修复",
		["Ln "] = "行 ",
		["Load more children…"] = "加载更多子项…",
		["Load more files…"] = "加载更多文件…",
		["Load more remotes…"] = "加载更多远程调用…",
		["Load more…"] = "加载更多…",
		["Load older calls…"] = "加载更早的调用…",
		["Lock now"] = "立即锁定",
		["Log cleared"] = "日志已清除",
		["Log details and context usage fit their contents and scroll when needed. Modal bodies have balanced padding, including the tutorial, Discord invitation and donation options."] = "日志详情与上下文用量按内容自适应，必要时滚动。弹窗正文内边距更均衡，包括新手指引、Discord 邀请与捐赠方式。",
		["Logs"] = "日志",
		["Logs & traces"] = "日志与追踪",
		["Longest streak"] = "最长连续",
		["Look up a Roblox account by username or id."] = "按用户名或 id 查询 Roblox 账号。",
		["Look up a Roblox place or asset by positive id. Native product metadata is cached for 60 seconds; refresh=true bypasses it. HTTP is a fallback when native lookup fails."] = "按正整数 id 查询 Roblox 场景或资产。原生产品元数据缓存 60 秒；refresh=true 可绕过。原生查询失败时回退到 HTTP。",
		["Low is the faster default; raise it for difficult tasks. Existing saved choices are kept. Sent as the provider's effort level where supported; raw provider parameters can override it. Provider default omits the effort field and may still think extensively. The Thinking row shows visible text, not a 5,999-token limit."] = "Low 是更快的默认值；难任务再调高。已保存的选择会保留。支持时作为提供商的 effort 级别发送；原始提供商参数可以覆盖它。选「提供商默认」会省略该字段，模型仍可能大量思考。Thinking 行显示的是可见文本，不是 5,999 Token 的额度。",
		["Lower is steadier; 0 is as deterministic as the provider allows. The current Claude models reject it, and it is not sent to them."] = "越低越稳定；0 是提供商允许范围内最确定的取值。当前 Claude 模型不接受它，因此不会发送。",
		-- m
		["MCP connections"] = "MCP 连接",
		["MCP, bridge redesign and queued follow-ups"] = "MCP、桥接重构与排队追问",
		["Main and worker prompts require precise function calls, observed targets, complete arguments and real results before reporting success. Detailed guides remain available when needed."] = "主代理与执行代理的提示词要求精确的函数调用、已观测的目标、完整参数与真实结果，之后才能报告成功。需要时仍可加载详细指南。",
		["Manage API keys"] = "管理 API 密钥",
		["Manage API keys opens a dedicated modal from provider details or connection setup. Name each masked entry, replace or remove it, and add more keys individually or in one paste."] = "「管理 API 密钥」可从提供商详情或连接设置打开独立弹窗。为每条掩码记录命名、替换或删除，也可逐条添加或一次性粘贴多把。",
		["Manage named API keys, pause individual entries and see their usage. Each conversation shows its AI request count. Rotation stays on by default, and modals have clearer spacing and fitted heights."] = "管理命名的 API 密钥、暂停单条并查看用量。每个对话显示其 AI 请求次数。轮换默认开启，弹窗间距与高度更规整。",
		["Manage providers"] = "管理提供商",
		["Manual bridge enabled"] = "启用手动桥接",
		["Manual connection"] = "手动连接",
		["Manual setup: download and start"] = "手动配置：下载并启动",
		["Markdown displayed as plain text"] = "Markdown 已按纯文本显示",
		["Match the port printed in the terminal, paste its Token, then turn Enabled on above. After restarting the bridge, paste the new token and reopen its browser link."] = "与终端打印的端口保持一致，粘贴其 Token，然后在上方启用。重启桥接后，请粘贴新令牌并重新打开浏览器链接。",
		["Matches a title, a message or a reply. %{count} on this client."] = "匹配标题、消息或回复。本客户端共 %{count} 个对话。",
		["Matching client, bridge, Windows and Android releases with bounded mobile transport, a refreshed desktop launcher, network capture and a smaller opt-in tool catalogue."] = "客户端、桥接、Windows 与 Android 端同步发布：移动传输加上边界控制、桌面启动器焕新、网络捕获，以及更小的可选工具目录。",
		["Maximum bytes kept from one tool result. A tool's own page limit can be smaller. Roughly four bytes per token for English text; code and Unicode vary."] = "单个工具结果保留的最大字节数。工具自身分页上限可能更小。英文约每 Token 四字节；代码与 Unicode 会有出入。",
		["Maximum generated tokens per request, including reasoning where the provider counts it. Model limits, available context and learned provider caps may lower it. This does not require the model to use the whole allowance."] = "每次请求最多生成的 Token，包含提供商计入的推理。模型限制、可用上下文与学到的提供商上限可能把它压低。这不要求模型用满额度。",
