		["OpenCode text, tool calls and tool-result replay passed with the companion's HTTP library on Windows. A user then confirmed OpenCode inference on a Delta Android phone through the UAI Relay app after one manual retry; mobile OpenCode now requires the UAI Relay app from Discord. Phone tool execution, tool-result replay and background survival remain unverified."] = "在 Windows 上用伴生端的 HTTP 库通过了 OpenCode 文本、工具调用与工具结果回放。随后有用户在一次手动重试后，通过 UAI Relay 应用在 Delta Android 手机上确认了 OpenCode 推理；移动端 OpenCode 现在需要来自 Discord 的 UAI Relay 应用。手机上的工具执行、工具结果回放与后台存活仍未验证。",
