		["Page players by distance, with username/display-name filter and deterministic ties. Distances are captured once per call. Continue with offset; restart if players move or leave."] = "按距离分页列出玩家，支持用户名/显示名过滤与稳定排序。距离在每次调用时采样一次。用 offset 继续；玩家移动或离开时请重新开始。",
		["Page top-level interfaces in PlayerGui and CoreGui, with enabled state and direct child counts. Does not enumerate every GUI descendant."] = "分页查看 PlayerGui 与 CoreGui 的顶层界面，含启用状态与直接子项数量。不会枚举所有 GUI 后代。",
