		["Preferences for this provider. Global settings still apply."] = "此提供商的偏好设置。全局设置仍然生效。",
		["Preserve mixed tool call order even when remote calls arrive out of order. Cancellation and invalid handoffs still stop the request; desktop actions are never approved."] = "即使远程调用乱序到达，也保持混合工具调用的顺序。取消与无效交接仍会终止请求；桌面端动作永不会被批准。",
		["Press a GUI button by firing the handlers connected to it. Needs a host that exposes signal introspection."] = "通过触发绑定在 GUI 按钮上的处理器来按下它。需要宿主支持信号内省。",
		["Press, hold or release a keyboard key. Holds belong to this conversation and release on up, cancellation or unload. Accepted/uncertain presses are never repeated through a fallback; after a release failure, use only action=up."] = "按下、长按或释放键盘按键。长按属于本对话，会在抬起、取消或卸载时释放。已接受或结果不确定的按键绝不通过回退重发；释放失败后只使用 action=up。",
		["Privacy"] = "隐私",
		["Privacy provides password changes, Lock now and the deliberate unprotected storage choice after unlocking. Forgotten-password removal discards saved vault credentials before returning to setup."] = "隐私页提供改密、「立即锁定」，以及解锁后主动选择不加密存储。忘记密码时可先丢弃保险库中保存的凭据，再回到设置流程。",
		["Progress and Cancel appear in the corner while encryption is prepared."] = "准备加密期间，进度与「取消」会显示在角落。",
		["Project UAI Free hours"] = "Project UAI Free 开放时段",
		["Project UAI Free includes shared access powered by HCNSEC. No personal key is required. You may use your own HCNSEC key instead; response times and shared capacity vary. Updates and help: https://discord.gg/9xYyyYuKap"] = "Project UAI Free 内置由 HCNSEC 提供的共享访问，无需个人密钥。你也可以改用自己的 HCNSEC 密钥；响应速度与共享容量会有所波动。更新与帮助：https://discord.gg/9xYyyYuKap",
		["Project UAI Free is ready"] = "Project UAI Free 已就绪",
		["Project UAI Free opens daily during 20:00–06:00 UTC+8 (Beijing/Singapore). Off-hours requests explain the schedule, and accepted replies continue after closing. Personal HCNSEC keys are unaffected."] = "Project UAI Free 每日 20:00–06:00（UTC+8，北京/新加坡）开放。时段外的请求会说明时间安排；已开始的回复会在关闭后继续。个人 HCNSEC 密钥不受影响。",
		["Project UAI cannot recover your password. If you forget it, you cannot unlock your saved API keys. Resetting the vault permanently removes every API key saved in this vault from UAI. You must enter them again."] = "Project UAI 无法找回你的密码。忘记密码就无法解锁已保存的 API 密钥。重置保险库会把其中保存的所有 API 密钥从 UAI 中永久移除，你需要重新输入。",
		["Prompt library"] = "提示词库",
		["Proposal · "] = "提案 · ",
		["Proposals"] = "提案",
		["Proposals "] = "提案 ",
		["Provider choices"] = "提供商选择",
		["Provider default"] = "提供商默认",
		["Provider fallback"] = "提供商回退",
		["Provider help, executor quirks and release news live in the Discord."] = "提供商帮助、执行器兼容问题与版本消息都在 Discord 里。",
		["Provider setup groups access, model and connection settings, with the setup guide expanded by default. The gallery adapts its card columns to the available width."] = "提供商设置把访问方式、模型与连接设置分组，配置指南默认展开。画廊的卡片列数会按可用宽度自适应。",
		["Providers"] = "提供商",
		["Providers & models"] = "提供商与模型",
		["Put text on the user's clipboard."] = "把文本放入用户剪贴板。",
		-- q
		["Queued messages"] = "排队消息",
		["Queued messages open as Up next: a state line, numbered cards with the next message marked, and edit, reorder and remove controls on a quiet row. An empty queue explains itself, and the edit dialog counts bytes as they are typed."] = "排队消息以「接下来」呈现：一行状态、带编号的卡片（下一条会被标出），以及在低调行上的编辑、重排与移除控件。空队列会自我说明，编辑对话框会随输入实时统计字节数。",
		["Queued messages show their count and review action above the composer instead of an empty bar."] = "排队消息会在输入框上方显示数量与查看操作，而不是一条空条。",
		["Quick chat key"] = "快捷聊天快捷键",
		["Quick chat opens in the middle of the screen, takes one message to the conversation the Chat panel shows, and closes itself."] = "快捷聊天在屏幕中央打开，把一条消息送入「对话」面板当前会话，然后自动关闭。",
		-- r
		["Raycast from a viewport fraction and return exact instance identity, hit position, normal, distance and material. Defaults to the crosshair, 10,000 studs, excluding your character and water. Does not capture pixels or infer ownership."] = "从视口比例位置发射射线，返回精确的实例身份、命中位置、法线、距离与材质。默认从准星出发、长度 10,000 studs，排除你的角色与水面。不会截取像素，也不推断归属。",
		["Reached %{provider} in %{time}"] = "已连上 %{provider}，用时 %{time}",
		["Reached the step limit of "] = "已达到步数上限 ",
		["Read Gravity's module guide/template (omit plugin), or real local/official shape source. Bounded source slices include continuation offsets. Read the guide before authoring a plugin; section=template returns a working module."] = "读取 Gravity 的模块指南/模板（省略 plugin），或读取真实的本地/官方形状源码。有界源码切片包含续读偏移。编写插件前先读指南；section=template 返回可用模块。",
		["Read a contiguous slice of a workspace file or saved paste. Use file_read_many for several known files or slices. The result includes a continuation offset when more remains."] = "读取工作区文件或已保存粘贴的一段连续内容。多个已知文件或片段请用 file_read_many。还有剩余内容时结果会包含续读偏移。",
		["Read a depth-limited tree within the result budget. Reports omitted/unreadable branches; use explorer_children for complete paginated children of a known handle."] = "在结果预算内读取深度受限的树。会报告被省略/不可读的分支；已知句柄的完整分页子项请用 explorer_children。",
		["Read a saved memory by exact key, search keys/values with a literal query, or list all memories. Historical facts may be stale; current instructions and observed state take precedence. Follow returned offsets with the same filters."] = "按精确键读取已保存记忆，用字面查询搜索键/值，或列出全部记忆。历史事实可能过期；当前指令与观测状态优先。后续读取沿用相同过滤条件与返回的偏移。",
		["Read a script's source. Works when the host can read or decompile it; when the host has no decompiler or it fails, the bundled luacid client and then the ByteFall service are tried. Many live scripts still cannot be read at all."] = "读取脚本源码。宿主能读取或反编译时可用；宿主没有反编译能力或失败时，会依次尝试内置 luacid 客户端与 ByteFall 服务。许多在线脚本仍然完全无法读取。",
		["Read a staged file's before/after source or a bounded line diff. Without path, list proposal metadata. Follow source continuation offsets or retained workspace_result_read fields. Reading never applies a proposal."] = "读取暂存文件的修改前/后源码或有界行级差异。省略 path 时列出提案元数据。按源码续读偏移或保留的 workspace_result_read 字段继续。读取永远不会应用提案。",
		["Read a version-1 project manifest and return file hashes, lexical function/local outlines and literal require dependencies without full source. Modules map IDs to relative .lua/.luau files; entry names an ID; tests is an optional array of test IDs. Use project_scaffold for a working example. Lexical hints are not type analysis."] = "读取版本 1 的项目清单，返回文件哈希、词法层面的函数/局部变量大纲以及字面 require 依赖，无需完整源码。modules 把 ID 映射到相对 .lua/.luau 文件；entry 指定某个 ID；tests 是可选的测试 ID 数组。可用 project_scaffold 生成一个可运行的示例。词法提示不等于类型分析。",
		["Read an authored .iy plugin from the executor workspace, or omit plugin to get a multi-command template. Follow nextOffset for long sources. Use this before updating a plugin with iy_plugin_write."] = "读取执行器工作区中已编写的 .iy 插件，或省略 plugin 获取多命令模板。长源码请跟随 nextOffset。更新插件前先用它。",
		["Read an enabled skill requested by the user or relevant to the task before applying it. Follow continuation offsets for the complete body; inventory descriptions are not bodies. Reuse unchanged bodies still in context; skip unrelated skills."] = "在应用之前，先读取用户指定或与任务相关的已启用技能。按续读偏移获取完整正文；清单里的说明不是正文。仍在上下文中且未变化的正文可直接复用；无关技能跳过。",
		["Read an instance's properties, attributes and tags. Do this before setting anything."] = "读取实例的属性、特性与标签。设置任何内容之前先做这一步。",
		["Read bounded retained detail for a large native tool result. Start with result_id; follow returned path arrays or offset. No source, object, or traffic is changed."] = "读取大型原生工具结果中保留下来的有界细节。先用 result_id，再按返回的路径数组或 offset 继续。不会修改源码、对象或网络流量。",
		["Read compressed POST messages before JSON validation, fixing invalid executor request errors for gzip submissions even when pairing already works. Request size limits, authentication and the original job identity remain enforced."] = "在 JSON 校验之前先读取压缩的 POST 消息，修复 gzip 提交时执行器报「请求无效」的问题，即使配对本身已正常。请求大小限制、认证与原始任务身份仍然生效。",
		["Read current lighting settings and up to 30 direct effects. Select properties to avoid unrelated reads."] = "读取当前光照设置及最多 30 个直接效果。只选择需要的属性以避免无关读取。",
		["Read full report"] = "阅读完整报告",
		["Read inputs with local inputs = ...; values are passed as data."] = "用 local inputs = ... 读取输入；值以数据形式传入。",
		["Read one of this user's other conversations by id (from conversation_list or conversation_search). Condensed by default: the whole thread with long turns shortened and tool runs collapsed, so a review costs one bounded read. Pass full=true for the verbatim transcript in UTF-8-safe byte slices, following nextOffset for the rest. Use it after a list or search points at a relevant thread, so you carry forward what was decided instead of re-deriving or re-asking it."] = "按 id 读取该用户的其他对话（来自 conversation_list 或 conversation_search）。默认精简：整条线索，长回合缩短、工具运行折叠，一次读取即可完成回顾。传 full=true 获取逐字记录（UTF-8 安全的字节切片），按 nextOffset 继续。用于列表或检索指向相关线索之后，从而延续既有结论，而不是重新推导或重复询问。",
		["Read or write an attribute on an instance. Omit value to read."] = "读取或写入实例上的特性。省略 value 表示读取。",
		["Read recent in-game chat in chronological pages. Continue backward with nextBeforeSequence and identical filters. History retains 100 messages; older evicted messages are unavailable."] = "按时间分页读取最近的游戏内聊天。用 nextBeforeSequence 与相同过滤条件向前翻。历史保留 100 条；更早被移除的消息不可用。",
		["Read retained tool results for this conversation after compaction. action=list returns compact receipts; action=search filters by tool or text; action=read pages one record's full text, structured data or summary. Offsets are bytes. The ledger never executes captured content."] = "在压缩之后读取本对话保留的工具结果。action=list 返回紧凑回执；action=search 按工具或文本过滤；action=read 分页读取单条记录的全文、结构化数据或摘要。偏移以字节计。账本绝不会执行捕获的内容。",
		["Read the bundled Project UAI UI LIB reference before creating a script UI. Covers responsive windows, controls, configuration, cleanup, embedding, application patterns, runtime integration and extending the shared library. Start with quickstart, controls and lifecycle; follow continuation offsets. No network or execution required."] = "创建脚本 UI 前，先读内置的 Project UAI UI LIB 参考。涵盖响应式窗口、控件、配置、清理、嵌入、应用模式、运行时集成与扩展共享库。从 quickstart、controls 与 lifecycle 入手；跟随续读偏移。无需网络或执行。",
		["Read the camera: position, field of view, type and subject."] = "读取相机：位置、视野、类型与目标。",
		["Read the current task list."] = "读取当前任务列表。",
		["Read the latest live source or a retained version/proposal. Returns the revision for edits and Run; source pages are at most 6,000 bytes."] = "读取最新的活动源码，或某个保留的版本/提案。会返回用于编辑与运行的修订号；每页源码最多 6,000 字节。",
		["Read the offline guide to the live Roblox environment and script development. Start with quickstart; select environment/capabilities, native workflows, shared state/concurrency, executor APIs with sUNC references, paths, inspection, Luau, cleanup, UI, debugging, projects, editor or verification as needed. Reuse retained sections. No network, filesystem access or execution required."] = "阅读关于当前 Roblox 环境与脚本开发的离线指南。从 quickstart 开始；按需选择 environment/capabilities、原生工作流、共享状态/并发、带 sUNC 参考的执行器 API、路径、检查、Luau、清理、UI、调试、项目、编辑器或验证。可复用已读章节。无需网络、文件访问或执行。",
		["Read up to 12 workspace files or saved pastes in one call, sharing the result budget. Each slice includes continuation offsets. Individual failures preserve other results."] = "一次读取最多 12 个工作区文件或已保存粘贴，共享结果预算。每个片段都带续读偏移。单个失败不影响其他结果。",
		["Read visible text under GUI roots using bounded cooperative traversal. Checks ancestor visibility and ScreenGui.Enabled; include_hidden opts into hidden text. Traversal order is not visual stacking order. Continue with the returned offset and identical filters."] = "以有界协作遍历读取 GUI 根节点下的可见文本。会检查祖先可见性与 ScreenGui.Enabled；include_hidden 可包含隐藏文本。遍历顺序不是视觉层叠顺序。用返回的 offset 与相同过滤条件继续。",
		["Read your character: position, health, movement values and what it is standing on."] = "读取你的角色：位置、生命值、移动参数以及脚下所站的对象。",
		["Reads a file from the client's folder and applies the settings in it. Providers, keys and the bridge token are never imported, because an export does not contain them."] = "从客户端文件夹读取文件并应用其中的设置。提供商、密钥和桥接令牌不会被导入，因为导出内容不包含它们。",
		["Ready to import"] = "可以导入",
		["Reasoning effort"] = "推理强度",
		["Reasoning levels"] = "推理级别",
		["Reasoning opens into a formatted view with its own Copy action. Errors explain what happened and offer recovery actions, with technical details available separately."] = "推理过程会展开为带格式的视图，并有自己的「复制」操作。错误会说明发生了什么并提供恢复操作，技术细节单独提供。",
		["Reasoning support"] = "推理支持",
		["Rebind offline call to current remote…"] = "将离线调用重新绑定到当前远程…",
		["Records redact credentials, link responses to compiled chunks by hash or thread, and flag code-like responses that never compile. Nothing is rewritten, replayed or executed by the capture."] = "记录会脱敏凭据，按哈希或线程把响应关联到已编译的代码块，并标记那些始终未编译的类代码响应。捕获不会重写、重放或执行任何内容。",
		["Recover earlier messages that compaction removed from the live context. list shows archived segments; search finds literal text; read pages one segment by UTF-8 byte offset. Use this after a handover when you need exact earlier wording, paths, tool output or a decision that was folded away. It never changes the conversation or re-runs a tool."] = "找回压缩时从活动上下文中移除的早期消息。list 显示归档分段；search 按字面文本查找；read 按 UTF-8 字节偏移分页读取某一段。交接之后需要精确措辞、路径、工具输出或被折叠的决策时使用。它不会修改对话，也不会重跑工具。",
		["Redo source"] = "重做源码修改",
		["Redraw messages and live activity"] = "重绘消息与实时活动",
		["Refresh conversation"] = "刷新对话",
		["Refresh files"] = "刷新文件列表",
		["Refresh folder"] = "刷新文件夹",
		["Refresh pricing and context information for 1,760 model entries. Known non-chat API types are omitted from supported mixed catalogs, while manual model IDs stay available."] = "刷新了 1,760 条模型条目的价格与上下文信息。受支持的混合目录会省略已知的非对话 API 类型，手动输入模型 ID 仍然可用。",
		["Refresh source"] = "刷新源码",
		["Refresh source snapshot"] = "刷新源码快照",
		["Relay mode is off, so the script calls providers directly."] = "中继模式已关闭，脚本会直接调用提供商。",
		["Release a staged proposal or recovery checkpoint. Does not change files; discarded recovery source is no longer available."] = "释放暂存的提案或恢复检查点。不会改动文件；被丢弃的恢复源码将不再可用。",
		["Reliable connections and a refreshed desktop"] = "更可靠的连接与焕新的桌面端",
		["Remember this answer"] = "记住此选择",
		["Reminders appear at most once every two weeks. Joining is optional."] = "提醒最多每两周出现一次，加入完全自愿。",
		["Remote name"] = "远程调用名称",
		["Remote spy"] = "远程调用监视",
		["Remove "] = "移除 ",
		["Remove LLM7. GitHub Models stays out because it was retired on 30 July 2026, and Perplexity and Databricks are not offered because this client's base-URL normaliser would send them to a path their APIs do not serve."] = "移除 LLM7。GitHub Models 因已于 2026 年 7 月 30 日下线而不再收录；Perplexity 与 Databricks 不提供，因为本客户端的 base URL 规范化会把它们指向其 API 并不提供的路径。",
		["Remove a plugin: unregisters its commands from Infinite Yield and deletes its .iy file. Accepts the name with or without the .iy ending."] = "移除插件：从 Infinite Yield 注销其命令并删除 .iy 文件。名称可带或不带 .iy 后缀。",
		["Remove folder"] = "删除文件夹",
		["Remove folder?"] = "删除文件夹？",
		["Remove input"] = "移除输入项",
		["Remove last interior keypoint"] = "移除最后一个内部关键点",
		["Remove saved credentials?"] = "移除已保存的凭据？",
		["Remove these %{count} follow-ups. The active response keeps running."] = "将移除 %{count} 条追问，当前回复会继续运行。",
		["Removing an uploading picture keeps it removed when the upload or a delayed event finishes, including after a browser reload."] = "上传中的图片被移除后，即使上传完成或有延迟事件到达（包括浏览器刷新后），它仍保持移除状态。",
		["Rename folder"] = "重命名文件夹",
		["Rename script"] = "重命名脚本",
		["Rename this conversation"] = "重命名此对话",
		["Rename this conversation to a short, specific title based on what it is actually about, so the user can pick the thread out of their list later. Call it once the subject is clear -- usually after the first exchange -- and again only when the work has genuinely moved on. Name the job, not the tools used. Never use it to replace a name the user set themselves; a conversation the user has named is not offered this tool."] = "依据对话的真实内容，把它重命名为简短明确的标题，便于用户以后在列表中辨认。主题清晰后调用一次——通常在第一轮交流之后——只有工作确实转向时才再次调用。命名任务本身，而不是所用工具。绝不要用它替换用户自己设置的名字；用户已命名的对话不会提供此工具。",
		["Reparent an instance."] = "更改实例的父级。",
		["Replace API key"] = "替换 API 密钥",
		["Replace an inclusive line range against expected_revision, preserving source outside the range. Never selects or runs the document."] = "在给定 expected_revision 的前提下替换一个闭区间行范围，范围之外的源码保持不变。不会选中或运行该文档。",
		["Replace exact text in a workspace file without rewriting the whole file. Read it first. Refuses missing or ambiguous matches unless replace_all is true, and refuses an edit if the file changed while it was being prepared. Files and edited output are limited to 2 MB."] = "在不重写整个文件的前提下替换工作区文件中的精确文本。请先读取。匹配缺失或有歧义时会拒绝，除非 replace_all 为 true；准备期间文件被改动也会拒绝。文件与编辑结果上限 2 MB。",
		["Replace the full task list. Use when substantial work benefits from a tracked plan; keep one item active while work remains. Routine tool sequences need no list."] = "替换完整任务列表。当工作较大且需要跟踪计划时使用；只要还有工作，就保持一项处于进行中。常规的工具序列不需要列表。",
		["Replace with another type"] = "替换为其他类型",
		["Replacing one API key preserves the other entries. Duplicate or empty replacements leave the pool intact, and short credentials stay masked in both entry rows and the pool summary."] = "替换单把密钥不会影响其他条目。重复或空的替换不会破坏密钥池，短凭据在条目行与密钥池摘要中都会保持掩码。",
		["Replay draft"] = "重放草稿",
		["Replay once"] = "重放一次",
		["Reply ceiling"] = "回复上限",
		["Reply language"] = "回复语言",
		["Reply ready"] = "回复已就绪",
		["Report Infinite Yield: the Settings mode, whether it is loaded, how it was obtained (already running, or loaded by this client), the command count and prefix. This inspection does not load IY; command tools ensure availability themselves."] = "报告 Infinite Yield：设置中的模式、是否已加载、来源（已在运行或由本客户端加载）、命令数量与前缀。此查看不会加载 IY；命令类工具会自行确保可用。",
		["Report the agent's own state: provider, model, token spend this session, context size, host capabilities and how many tools are available."] = "报告代理自身状态：提供商、模型、本次会话 Token 消耗、上下文大小、宿主能力与可用工具数量。",
		["Report the current Roblox client release version."] = "报告当前 Roblox 客户端的发布版本。",
		["Repository link copied. Paste it into your browser to visit GitHub."] = "仓库链接已复制，粘贴到浏览器即可访问 GitHub。",
		["Request history"] = "请求历史",
		["Request history cleared"] = "请求历史已清除",
		["Request timeout"] = "请求超时",
		["Requests appear here with status, duration and transport details after you send a message."] = "发送消息后，请求会带着状态、耗时与传输详情显示在这里。",
		["Reset admission filters"] = "重置准入过滤器",
		["Reset all settings"] = "重置所有设置",
		["Reset counters"] = "重置计数",
		["Reset every setting?"] = "重置所有设置？",
		["Reset pairing"] = "重置配对",
		["Reset the activity history?"] = "重置活动记录？",
		["Reset the launcher"] = "重置启动按钮",
		["Reset window position"] = "重置窗口位置",
		["Resolve an IY selector to concrete names in the live server (read-only). Keywords: all, others, me, random, #<n>, %<team>, allies, enemies, team, nonteam, friends, nonfriends, guests, bacons, age<n>, nearest, farthest, group<id>, alive, dead, rad<n>, cursor, npcs. Supports + include/- exclude, comma-separated lists, and @name for username-only prefix matching. Uses the running IY's selector behavior; resolve targets before iy_cmd."] = "把 IY 选择器解析为当前服务器中的具体名称（只读）。关键词：all、others、me、random、#<n>、%<team>、allies、enemies、team、nonteam、friends、nonfriends、guests、bacons、age<n>、nearest、farthest、group<id>、alive、dead、rad<n>、cursor、npcs。支持 + 包含 / - 排除、逗号分隔列表，以及 @name 仅按用户名前缀匹配。行为与正在运行的 IY 一致；执行 iy_cmd 前先解析目标。",
		["Resume queued"] = "继续发送队列",
		["Retain large tool results in a per-conversation evidence ledger. The default 8 KiB threshold skips small results and already-persistent tools, deduplicates repeats and writes through a bounded queue instead of blocking each tool call. Switch to all or off in Settings. The evidence tool lists, searches and pages full text or structured data after compaction; evidence_clear removes a conversation's ledger."] = "把大型工具结果保留在按对话分开的证据账本中。默认 8 KiB 阈值会跳过小结果与本身已持久化的工具，对重复内容去重，并通过有界队列写入，而不是阻塞每次工具调用。可在设置中改为「全部」或「关闭」。evidence 工具可在压缩后列出、搜索并分页读取全文或结构化数据；evidence_clear 会清除某次对话的账本。",
		["Retries"] = "重试次数",
		["Retry workspace autosave"] = "重试工作区自动保存",
		["Return to editable script"] = "返回可编辑脚本",
		["Reveal active file"] = "定位当前文件",
		["Reveal in Explorer"] = "在资源管理器中定位",
		["Reveal path"] = "定位路径",
		["Reveal reference"] = "定位引用",
		["Reveal remote in Explorer"] = "在资源管理器中定位该远程",
		["Review"] = "检查",
		["Review each subagent's task, progress, tools and results in richer preview modals, and send a contextual follow-up when its work finishes."] = "在更丰富的预览弹窗中查看每个子代理的任务、进度、工具与结果，并在其工作结束后发送带上下文的追问。",
		["Review portable script"] = "检查可移植脚本",
		["Review replay"] = "检查重放",
		["Review the remote path and arguments in this runnable Luau."] = "在这段可运行的 Luau 中检查远程路径与参数。",
		["Review, edit, reorder and clear pending follow-ups in Roblox and the browser. Stale edits are rejected and attachments stay with their message."] = "在 Roblox 与浏览器中查看、编辑、重排与清除待处理的追问。过期编辑会被拒绝，附件随消息保留。",
		["Roblox receives real text and reasoning previews during bridge inference through short status polls. The browser keeps its live provider stream, and the full reply replaces the preview once."] = "桥接推理期间，Roblox 通过短状态轮询获得真实的文本与推理预览。浏览器保留实时提供商流，完整回复到达后只替换一次预览。",
		["Roblox will move you to the Project Ptolemy donation place. "] = "Roblox 会把你传送到 Project Ptolemy 捐赠场景。",
		["Roblox will move you to the Project Ptolemy donation place. Your conversations and settings are saved before you leave."] = "Roblox 会把你传送到 Project Ptolemy 捐赠场景。离开前会保存你的对话和设置。",
		["Robux donations go to the Project Ptolemy donation place; supporters are thanked in our Discord. "] = "Robux 捐赠会进入 Project Ptolemy 捐赠场景；支持者会在我们的 Discord 中被致谢。",
		["Robux donations go to the Project Ptolemy donation place; supporters are thanked in our Discord. Ko-fi copies its link, which you can open in a browser."] = "Robux 捐赠会进入 Project Ptolemy 捐赠场景；支持者会在我们的 Discord 中被致谢。Ko-fi 会复制链接，你可以用浏览器打开。",
		["Rolling summary"] = "滚动摘要",
		["Roomier model selection, visible queued messages, readable tool errors and live bridge progress in Roblox."] = "更宽松的模型选择、可见的排队消息、可读的工具错误，以及 Roblox 内的实时桥接进度。",
		["Rotate keys"] = "轮换密钥",
		["Rotate keys is the default. Choose Use one key to send this provider's requests through a specific entry; other keys stay saved. Removing the selected key restores rotation."] = "默认「轮换密钥」。选择「使用单把密钥」可让该提供商的请求固定走某一条；其他密钥仍然保存。删除所选密钥会恢复轮换。",
		["Rotate keys only takes turns between existing keys. Replace keys at the provider and revoke the old ones to rotate credentials securely. Revoke immediately if a key is stolen."] = "「轮换密钥」只是在现有密钥之间轮流使用。要安全地轮换凭据，请在提供商处更换密钥并吊销旧的。密钥一旦泄露，请立即吊销。",
		["Run a document to see its output here."] = "运行文档后，输出会显示在这里。",
		["Run a script template by id with the given values. The expanded code appears in the permission prompt before it runs -- what you approve is what runs, because placeholders are filled before the permission decision, not after."] = "按 id 运行脚本模板并传入给定值。展开后的代码会在运行前显示在权限提示中——你批准的就是实际运行的，因为占位符在权限判定之前就已填充，而不是之后。",
		["Run an Infinite Yield command by its command string, exactly as typed into IY's own bar: 'speed 100', 'noclip', 'tp PlayerName', 'esp players'. Supports IY's repeat prefixes ('5^speed 100', 'inf^0.5^esp'). When the setting is on but IY is not loaded, this call loads it."] = "按命令字符串执行 Infinite Yield 命令，写法与在 IY 自己的命令栏中完全一致：'speed 100'、'noclip'、'tp PlayerName'、'esp players'。支持 IY 的重复前缀（'5^speed 100'、'inf^0.5^esp'）。设置已开启但 IY 未加载时，本次调用会加载它。",
		["Run bounded Luau on the local client. Provide inline source in 'code', or 'path' to run a workspace file directly without reading it back first. Captures print/warn, tables and all return values; waits for functions started with task.spawn/defer/delay. Stop or the deadline cancels managed tasks. Loop checkpoints yield automatically. Prefer a specific tool when one exists. This is not a security sandbox; dynamically loaded code and engine calls can bypass cooperative guards."] = "在本地客户端运行有界 Luau。用 'code' 提供内联源码，或用 'path' 直接运行工作区文件而不必先读回。会捕获 print/warn、表与所有返回值；会等待由 task.spawn/defer/delay 启动的函数。停止或到达时限会取消受管理的任务。循环检查点会自动让出。已有专用工具时优先用它。这不是安全沙箱；动态加载的代码与引擎调用可以绕过协作式防护。",
		["Run output"] = "运行输出",
		["Run with inputs"] = "带输入运行",
		-- s
		["START HERE"] = "从这里开始",
		["Save"] = "保存",
		["Save a durable fact about this user or project under a short key. Survives context compaction and restarts. Use for preferences, paths and goals, not for transcript chatter."] = "用简短的键保存关于此用户或项目的长期事实。可在上下文压缩与重启后保留。用于偏好、路径与目标，不用于对话闲聊。",
		["Save a skill: a named playbook with a one-line description and a markdown body. Overwrites an existing skill of the same name. Use it when the user asks to keep a working approach -- 'save that as a skill' -- or when you worked something out that a later session will need again."] = "保存一个技能：带名称、一行说明与 markdown 正文的操作手册。同名技能会被覆盖。当用户要求保留某个可行做法（“把这个存成技能”），或你摸索出的方法以后还会用到时使用。",
		["Save as action"] = "保存为动作",
		["Save as action…"] = "保存为动作…",
		["Save changes"] = "保存修改",
		["Save file as…"] = "另存为…",
		["Save file · Ctrl+S"] = "保存文件 · Ctrl+S",
		["Save named version"] = "保存为命名版本",
		["Saved "] = "已保存 ",
		["Saved action revision "] = "已保存动作版本 ",
		["Saved credentials were omitted. After applying keys, open Edit connection to review custom authentication and save the full connection before sending requests."] = "已保存的凭据被省略。应用密钥后，请打开「编辑连接」检查自定义认证，并在发送请求前保存完整连接。",
		["Scan now"] = "立即扫描",
		["Script UI"] = "脚本 UI",
		["Search Tools and Logs with multiple words and open full details when needed. Tool discovery respects the current conversation's permissions and available tool groups."] = "工具与日志支持多词搜索，需要时可打开完整详情。工具发现会遵循当前对话的权限与可用工具分组。",
		["Search a subtree for instances by name and/or class. Stops when the requested result count is reached. For selected properties and paginated results, use instance_query."] = "按名称和/或类在子树中查找实例。达到请求数量即停止。选定的属性与分页结果请用 instance_query。",
		["Search by a tool name or what you want it to do."] = "按工具名或你想让它做的事搜索。",
		["Search conversations"] = "搜索对话",
		["Search host, status, tool or message"] = "搜索宿主、状态、工具或消息",
		["Search models..."] = "搜索模型...",
		["Search models…"] = "搜索模型…",
		["Search name"] = "搜索名称",
		["Search options…"] = "搜索选项…",
		["Search other conversations and saved pastes for prior work using a literal query. Returns exact conversation IDs or paste paths and snippets; read details with conversation_read or file_read. scope can restrict the search. Work is bounded and incomplete searches are disclosed; narrow follow-ups rather than assuming absence. The current conversation is excluded."] = "用字面查询在本用户的其他对话与已保存粘贴中检索既往工作。返回精确的对话 ID 或粘贴路径与片段；细节用 conversation_read 或 file_read 读取。scope 可限定检索范围。检索有边界，未完成时会明确提示；应继续缩小范围，而不是假定不存在。当前对话被排除。",
		["Search providers or models"] = "搜索提供商或模型",
		["Search remote names"] = "搜索远程调用名称",
		["Search saved providers..."] = "搜索已保存的提供商...",
		["Search script and action names"] = "搜索脚本与动作名称",
		["Search the Infinite Yield community plugin store (iyplugins.pages.dev, several hundred plugins) by name, author or filename. Returns matches with their authors. Use it when the user asks for a feature core IY does not have, then install with iy_plugin_install."] = "按名称、作者或文件名搜索 Infinite Yield 社区插件商店（iyplugins.pages.dev，数百个插件）。返回匹配项及其作者。当用户想要 IY 核心没有的功能时使用，然后用 iy_plugin_install 安装。",
		["Search the web and return titles, URLs and snippets. Use when the answer depends on something current or outside the game."] = "搜索网页并返回标题、URL 与摘要。当答案依赖时效信息或游戏之外的内容时使用。",
		["Search this provider's models..."] = "搜索此提供商的模型...",
		["Search tools"] = "搜索工具",
		["Search tools, groups or actions"] = "搜索工具、分组或动作",
		["Seconds before a tool is abandoned. Subagents are exempt: they run to their own budget below."] = "工具被放弃前的秒数。子代理不受此限，它们按下方自身的预算运行。",
		["Seconds one subagent may work before it wraps up. The main agent can continue its own work and check progress while the child runs. Ignored while the switch below is on."] = "单个子代理在被收尾前可工作的秒数。子代理运行期间，主代理可以继续自己的工作并查看进度。打开下方开关后此项忽略。",
		["See every tool"] = "查看所有工具",
		["See your character's current state."] = "查看角色当前状态。",
		["Select Review to validate this configuration."] = "选择「检查」以校验此配置。",
		["Select a Gravity shape, configure its control keys, or press one real Button. Inspect gravity_shapes(name=...) first. Values use stored units (display divided by Div). Buttons require that shape to be selected and never become settings."] = "选择一个 Gravity 形状、配置其控制键，或按下一个真实按钮。请先查看 gravity_shapes(name=...)。取值使用存储单位（显示值除以 Div）。按钮要求该形状已被选中，且按钮永远不会变成设置项。",
		["Select a captured call"] = "选择一条已捕获调用",
		["Select a request or log entry to inspect its details."] = "选择一条请求或日志以查看详情。",
		["Select an entry"] = "选择一条记录",
		["Select an object"] = "选择一个对象",
		["Select and copy"] = "选中并复制",
		["Select and copy the invite above."] = "请选择并复制上方的邀请链接。",
		["Select and copy the repository link above, then open it in your browser."] = "请选中并复制上面的仓库链接，然后在浏览器中打开。",
		["Select several Library scripts or actions and delete them with one confirmation. Changed items are checked before the whole batch is removed."] = "在库中多选脚本或动作，一次确认即可删除。整批移除前会检查被改动过的条目。",
		["Selected remote"] = "选中的远程调用",
		["Selected subtree"] = "选中的子树",
		["Send"] = "发送",
		["Send a follow-up while UAI is working and it will wait here, in order."] = "UAI 正在工作时发送追问，它会在这里按顺序等待。",
		["Send a message into Roblox chat. Reports a failure if no channel is available."] = "向 Roblox 聊天发送一条消息。没有可用频道时报告失败。",
		["Send follow-up"] = "发送追问",
		["Send follow-up messages in Roblox or the bridge while the agent is running. They queue in order for the next safe response or tool boundary. Pending messages stay visible and Stop remains a separate action."] = "在代理运行时，可从 Roblox 或桥接发送追问。它们会按顺序排队，等待下一个安全的回复点或工具边界。待处理消息始终可见，「停止」仍是独立操作。",
		["Send one HTTP request with method and body. Writes are never retried. HTTP errors fail the call; large responses remain readable through http_result_read."] = "发送一次带方法与请求体的 HTTP 请求。写操作永不重试。HTTP 错误会使调用失败；大响应仍可通过 http_result_read 读取。",
		["Send temperature"] = "发送 temperature",
		["Send the Claude Code identity"] = "发送 Claude Code 身份标识",
		["Server setup and API documentation are at the address above."] = "服务器配置与 API 文档见上述地址。",
		["Session bookmarks"] = "会话书签",
		["Set Gravity's anchor to yourself or all players, add/remove a specific target, or clear targeting. Ambiguous player names are refused. Preserves the native Targets table."] = "把 Gravity 的锚点设为自己或所有玩家，添加/移除指定目标，或清除目标。玩家名称有歧义时会拒绝。会保留原生 Targets 表。",
		["Set master password"] = "设置主密码",
		["Set one property on one instance. The value is converted to the property's existing type, so 'Size' takes '4, 1, 2' on a part and '0, 200, 0, 40' on a GUI frame."] = "在一个实例上设置一个属性。值会转换为该属性现有类型，因此 'Size' 在部件上接受 '4, 1, 2'，在 GUI 框架上接受 '0, 200, 0, 40'。",
		["Set or clear one native Gravity hotkey on desktop or mobile. Provide action or shape, and a Roblox KeyCode name (e.g. E, F5); key=\"\" unbinds it. Refuses conflicts with other core/shape bindings. Read current keybinds in gravity_status."] = "在桌面或移动端设置或清除一个原生 Gravity 热键。提供 action 或 shape，以及 Roblox KeyCode 名称（例如 E、F5）；key=\"\" 表示解绑。与其他核心/形状绑定的冲突会被拒绝。当前键位可在 gravity_status 中查看。",
		["Set up"] = "配置",
		["Settings"] = "设置",
		["Settings reset"] = "设置已重置",
		["Share of the model's context window at which older turns are summarised, when the window is known. Lower compacts sooner and cheaper; higher keeps more history in view. The Context budget above is still a hard ceiling."] = "在已知窗口的情况下，较早回合被汇总时所占上下文窗口的比例。越低越早压缩、越省；越高保留更多历史。「上下文上限」仍是硬顶。",
		["Shared value from 0 to 2. Models set to omit do not send it."] = "共享值，范围 0–2。设为不发送的模型不会传该字段。",
		["Sheet"] = "浮层",
		["Show a short message to the user as a toast in the agent's own interface. Use it for something worth noticing, not for your reply."] = "在代理自己的界面中以浮层显示一条简短消息。用于值得注意的事项，而不是你的回复。",
		["Show all %{count} lines"] = "展开全部 %{count} 行",
		["Show context details"] = "显示上下文详情",
		["Show excluded remotes"] = "显示被排除的远程调用",
		["Show failures"] = "显示失败项",
		["Show full"] = "显示全部",
		["Show full message"] = "显示完整消息",
		["Show less"] = "收起",
		["Show reasoning"] = "显示推理过程",
		["Show retained calls for this remote"] = "显示此远程调用的已保留记录",
		["Show the activity card"] = "显示活动卡片",
		["Show the code a tool was given"] = "显示工具收到的代码",
		["Show the detected CLI version and useful setup guidance when its server API is incompatible."] = "当 CLI 的服务端 API 不兼容时，显示检测到的版本与有用的配置指引。",
		["Show the remember switch on each prompt."] = "在每条提示旁显示记忆开关。",
		["Show token counts"] = "显示 Token 用量",
		["Six short steps. Close any time and reopen from your profile menu."] = "六个简短步骤。随时关闭，可从个人菜单再次打开。",
		["Skills"] = "技能",
		["Some final values are unknown. Inspect the recorded fields."] = "部分最终值未知，请查看已记录的字段。",
		["Source document was deleted"] = "源文档已被删除",
		["Stage 1-20 coordinated file creates/replacements/exact edits without writing files. Existing targets require expected_hash from project_map or script_analyze; new targets require create=true. Review with project_patch_read, then apply. Proposals/checkpoints are conversation-owned, expire in ten minutes and do not persist across unload."] = "暂存 1–20 个协同的文件新建/替换/精确编辑，但不写盘。已有目标需要来自 project_map 或 script_analyze 的 expected_hash；新目标需要 create=true。先用 project_patch_read 检查，再应用。提案/检查点归对话所有，十分钟后过期，卸载后不保留。",
		["Stage a working modular script project: uai.project.json, main.lua, settings.lua and tests/settings.lua. All destinations must be new. Returns a proposal for review/apply; nothing runs. Generated require uses declared project IDs. Add interfaces through Project UAI UI LIB."] = "暂存一个可运行的模块化脚本项目：uai.project.json、main.lua、settings.lua 与 tests/settings.lua。所有目标路径必须是新的。返回提案供检查/应用；不会运行任何内容。生成的 require 使用声明的项目 ID。界面请通过 Project UAI UI LIB 添加。",
		["Star us on GitHub"] = "在 GitHub 上给个 Star",
		["Start"] = "开始",
		["Start UAI Relay on this phone. The script hands long provider requests to it, so the executor's request limit cannot cut them off. Pairing is automatic; no token copying."] = "在这台手机上启动 UAI Relay。脚本会把耗时较长的模型请求交给它，避免被执行器的请求时限打断。配对自动完成，无需复制令牌。",
		["Start a background loop cycling through supplied Roblox chat messages. Returns immediately. Stop with chat_loop_stop."] = "在后台循环发送给定的 Roblox 聊天消息。立即返回。用 chat_loop_stop 停止。",
		["Start a self-contained task in a background subagent and immediately receive its id. Keep doing your own independent work while it runs; check agent_status periodically and collect its report before your final answer. Give each worker a distinct scope and avoid concurrent edits to the same file or runtime state. A subagent cannot ask questions, so include the full task and completion criteria. Set background=false only when this tool call must wait for the report."] = "在后台子代理中启动独立任务，并立即获得其 id。它运行期间继续做自己独立的工作；定期查看 agent_status，并在最终回答前收集报告。给每个执行者明确的范围，避免并发修改同一文件或运行时状态。子代理无法提问，因此要写全任务与完成标准。仅当必须等待报告时才设 background=false。",
		["Start an empty replay draft?"] = "新建空白重放草稿？",
		["Start an independent AI chatbot in Roblox chat using the currently selected provider/model. Maintains its own conversation memory and replies to new player messages without keeping this agent turn open. Batches rapid messages, ignores self/system echoes, and suppresses duplicate inputs and repeated replies. Do not also reply with chat_send. Stop/status through chat_loop_stop/chat_loop_status."] = "用当前选中的提供商/模型在 Roblox 聊天中启动独立 AI 聊天机器人。它维护自己的对话记忆并回复新玩家消息，且不占用本回合。会合并密集消息、忽略自己与系统回声、抑制重复输入与重复回复。不要再通过 chat_send 回复。用 chat_loop_stop/chat_loop_status 停止或查看状态。",
		["Start chatting"] = "开始对话",
		["Start command copied"] = "启动命令已复制",
		["Start keyword-based auto-replies to other players in Roblox chat. Uses supplied rules, ignores self/system messages, and sends at most one reply per interval. No ongoing inference requests."] = "按关键词向其他玩家自动回复。使用给定规则，忽略自己与系统消息，每个间隔最多回复一次。不会持续调用模型。",
		["Start over"] = "重新开始",
		["Start with the sidebar collapsed"] = "启动时收起侧栏",
		["Status, quiz scores, and stop controls"] = "状态、测验得分与停止控制",
		["Step limit"] = "步数上限",
		["Stop"] = "停止",
		["Stop a managed chat loop immediately, or use id='all' to stop every chat loop. An already submitted message cannot be recalled."] = "立即停止一个受管理的聊天循环，或用 id='all' 停止全部。已提交的消息无法撤回。",
		["Stop all"] = "全部停止",
		["Stop condition"] = "停止条件",
		["Stopping "] = "正在停止 ",
		["Stops the current turn, drains every timer and input handler, "] = "停止当前回合，释放所有计时器与输入监听，",
		["Stops the current turn, drains every timer and input handler, saves your settings and removes the interface. Run the loader again to come back."] = "停止当前回合、释放所有计时器与输入监听、保存设置并移除界面。重新运行加载器即可恢复。",
		["Streamed replies carry reasoning text and token counts. Turning this off always takes effect; turning it on only does while Settings has streaming on."] = "流式回复会携带推理文本与 Token 计数。关闭总是生效；开启仅在设置中也开启流式时有效。",
		["Streamed replies carry reasoning text and usage counts."] = "流式回复会携带推理文本与用量数据。",
		["Streaming responses"] = "流式响应",
		["Stronger agents and desktop bridge"] = "更强的代理与桌面桥接",
		["Subagent budget"] = "子代理时限",
		["Subagent steps"] = "子代理步数",
		["Subagents alive at once across the whole tree. Several dispatched in one step run together; this is the ceiling on how many, including the ones a subagent starts itself. Anything over it waits for a slot."] = "整棵代理树中同时存活的子代理数。同一步派发的多个会一起运行；这是数量上限，包含子代理自己派发的那些。超出者等待空位。",
		["Subagents and environment guidance"] = "子代理与环境指南",
		["Submit a ClickDetector, ProximityPrompt hold, or part touch interaction. Prompt/touch holds are released on cancellation or unload; host acceptance does not prove a server response."] = "提交 ClickDetector、ProximityPrompt 长按或部件触摸交互。提示/触摸长按会在取消或卸载时释放；宿主接受不代表服务器已响应。",
		["Summarise old turns"] = "汇总较早回合",
