		["Tell your agent what you have in mind…"] = "告诉你的代理你的想法…",
		["Temperature"] = "温度",
		["Temperature settings now live under Models → Options → Temperature, leaving more room for the model list. Free-model outlines are softer in Roblox."] = "温度设置已移到 模型 → 选项 → 温度，为模型列表腾出更多空间。Roblox 中免费模型的描边更柔和。",
		["Test connection"] = "测试连接",
		["Text scale"] = "文字缩放",
		["Thank you for your continued use and support of Project UAI. Free access powered by HCNSEC is included daily 20:00-12:00 UTC+8 (Beijing/Singapore), through the following midday, with no account or personal key needed. Outside these hours, choose another provider or return at 20:00 UTC+8. Speed and availability vary with shared capacity. More free providers may be available soon."] = "感谢你继续使用与支持 Project UAI。内置由 HCNSEC 提供的免费额度，每日 20:00–12:00（UTC+8，北京/新加坡）可用，一直持续到次日中午，无需账号或个人密钥。时段之外请选择其他提供商，或在 20:00（UTC+8）后再来。速度与可用性会随共享容量波动，更多免费提供商可能很快上线。",
		["Thank you for your continued use and support of Project UAI. Free access powered by HCNSEC is included, with no account or personal key needed. Speed and availability vary with shared capacity. More free providers may be available soon."] = "感谢你一直使用并支持 Project UAI。内置由 HCNSEC 提供的免费额度，无需账号或个人密钥。速度与可用性会随共享容量波动，更多免费提供商可能很快上线。",
		["That file had no settings in it"] = "该文件中没有设置项",
		["The Claude Code Settings tab is now named Project UAI."] = "Claude Code 设置页已更名为 Project UAI。",
		["The Windows app's Tunnels tab brings OpenCode, Kilo and Cline status and controls together. Install Cline separately, enable it and sign in, then choose Cline in the provider gallery and fetch its current free models."] = "Windows 应用的「隧道」页集中显示 OpenCode、Kilo 与 Cline 的状态与控制。Cline 需单独安装、启用并登录，然后在提供商画廊选择 Cline 并获取其当前免费模型。",
		["The accent border follows highlighted providers in the catalog, so it stays on Project UAI Free, AgentRouter and OpenCode Zen rather than on whichever card happens to be first."] = "强调色边框跟随目录中被打上重点标记的提供商，因此始终落在 Project UAI Free、AgentRouter 与 OpenCode Zen 上，而不是碰巧排在第一的卡片。",
		["The agent hands self-contained work to a subagent with dispatch_agent: its own context, a subset of the tools, and a written report at the end. Open an agent to watch its current step, tool progress, latest messages and report."] = "代理通过 dispatch_agent 把独立的工作交给子代理：拥有自己的上下文、一部分工具，并在最后交出书面报告。打开某个子代理即可查看它当前步骤、工具进度、最新消息与报告。",
		["The agent is asking"] = "代理正在询问",
		["The captured call is preserved. The new draft begins with zero arguments."] = "已捕获的调用会保留，新草稿从零个参数开始。",
		["The catalog grows to 66 presets. Recommended begins with Project UAI Free, AgentRouter, OpenCode Zen, OpenRouter and OpenCode Go, followed by the free-tier and no-key routes."] = "预设增至 66 个。「推荐」以 Project UAI Free、AgentRouter、OpenCode Zen、OpenRouter 和 OpenCode Go 开头，其后是免费层与免密钥线路。",
		["The claude-cli User-Agent and its client headers. Turning this off suppresses the whole set for this endpoint whatever the global switch says, which is the one lever this client has when a CDN in front of an API refuses the request."] = "claude-cli 的 User-Agent 及其客户端请求头。关闭后会在此端点抑制整套标识，不受全局开关影响——当 API 前面的 CDN 拒绝请求时，这是本客户端唯一的手段。",
		["The client, bridge, Windows app and Android companion all ship as 3.7.0. The desktop app checks installed tunnel helpers before Cowork starts and shows their setup status."] = "客户端、桥接、Windows 应用与 Android 伴生端统一发布 3.7.0。桌面应用会在 Cowork 启动前检查已安装的隧道助手，并显示其配置状态。",
		["The composer's queue strip is tinted and carries the held state as a dot instead of only in words."] = "输入框的队列条加了底色，并用圆点表示「已保留」，不再只靠文字。",
		["The conversation header shows its AI request count. Retries, tool follow-ups, summaries and subagents are included; model discovery and relay polling are excluded."] = "对话标题栏显示其 AI 请求次数。包含重试、工具跟进、摘要与子代理；不包含模型发现与中继轮询。",
		["The conversation list can always be brought back with the toggle in the header."] = "随时可用顶部栏的开关重新展开对话列表。",
		["The endpoint and its key are deleted from this device."] = "该端点及其密钥将从本机删除。",
		["The endpoint and its key are deleted from this device. This cannot be undone."] = "该端点及其密钥将从本机删除，且无法恢复。",
		["The font for menus, navigation and messages. Shows the families available on this device."] = "用于菜单、导航与消息的字体。只显示此设备可用的字族。",
		["The gallery has more room: wider card gaps, a taller dialog and bottom padding so the last card clears the edge."] = "画廊更宽松：卡片间距更大、对话框更高，底部留出内边距，让最后一张卡片不贴边。",
		["The greeting and the counters an empty conversation opens with."] = "空对话开场时的问候语与统计计数。",
		["The included community key has been replaced. Old included credentials migrate on the official endpoint; saved configs and exports use a reference. Bundle encoding deters simple searches but cannot make a client-held key secret."] = "内置社区密钥已更换。旧的凭据会在官方端点自动迁移；已保存的配置与导出中改用引用。包内编码只能挡住简单搜索，无法让客户端持有的密钥真正保密。",
		["The model picker shows your current provider and model together, with connection and free-model information. Search saved providers in the new switcher without losing your model search, effort controls or custom model options."] = "模型选择器同时显示当前提供商与模型，并给出连接与免费模型信息。新的切换器可搜索已保存的提供商，且不会丢失模型搜索、强度控制或自定义模型选项。",
		["The model picks one of these per dispatch. 'read' is the default and cannot change anything; a delegated write is hard to attribute afterwards, which is why it has to be asked for."] = "模型每次派发时从中选择一个。'read' 是默认值，不能修改任何内容；被委派的写入事后很难归因，所以必须显式申请。",
		["The monospace family for code and diagnostics. Roblox renders from a fixed set of families, so this offers the ones that exist rather than a box to type a font name into that could not be loaded."] = "代码与诊断信息使用的等宽字体。Roblox 只能渲染固定的字族集合，因此这里提供已存在的字族，而不是一个可以输入字体名却无法加载的输入框。",
		["The picker gives touch controls more room and keeps reasoning settings reachable above the keyboard. Model menus and large saved catalogs support multiword search, with refresh and manual entry available when no models match."] = "选择器为触屏控件留出更多空间，并让推理设置在键盘上方可达。模型菜单与大型已保存目录支持多词搜索；没有匹配时可刷新或手动输入。",
		["The provider cut off this tool batch at its token limit. No calls in this batch ran. Send smaller complete calls; split large scripts into sequential file_write/file_append calls or targeted file_edit edits."] = "提供商在 Token 上限处截断了这批工具调用，本批次没有任何调用执行。请改为更小的完整调用；把大脚本拆成多次 file_write/file_append，或使用定向的 file_edit。",
		["The refreshed desktop dashboard offers persistent OpenCode tunnel, MCP server, browser-open and automatic app-update switches. Minimize stays on the taskbar; closing stops Cowork and exits."] = "焕新的桌面仪表盘提供可持久保存的 OpenCode 隧道、MCP 服务器、打开浏览器与自动更新开关。最小化后仍留在任务栏；关闭则停止 Cowork 并退出。",
		["The same value as the text scale under General."] = "与「常规」中的文字缩放是同一个值。",
		["The sidebar's Customize row is now Settings and opens the settings modal on the General pane; the duplicate Settings entry under More is removed. The profile menu's Tutorial row has its icon."] = "侧栏的「自定义」一行改为「设置」，点击在「常规」页打开设置弹窗；「更多」下重复的设置入口已移除。个人菜单里的「新手指引」也补上了图标。",
		["The tool produced no result."] = "该工具没有返回结果。",
		["The transcript and its file are both removed. This cannot be undone."] = "对话记录及其文件都会被删除，且无法恢复。",
		["The transcript and the model's context are both discarded."] = "对话记录与模型上下文都会被丢弃。",
		["The transcript is untouched; only what the list calls it changes."] = "对话记录不受影响，只改变列表里显示的名称。",
		["The type the interface itself is set in."] = "界面本身使用的字体。",
		["The vault uses AES-256-SIV and PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 entirely in Luau. Setup and password changes verify the encrypted save before switching. Cancel and failed writes preserve live keys; scripts sharing the executor can still intercept credentials during use."] = "保险库完全用 Luau 实现 AES-256-SIV 与 PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256。设置与改密都会先校验加密写入再切换。取消或写入失败会保留正在使用的密钥；共用执行器的脚本仍可能在凭据使用时拦截它们。",
		["The widest the transcript and the composer will grow on a large screen."] = "在大屏幕上对话区与输入框的最大宽度。",
		["These exact objects are bound to this action. Hierarchy operations are outside supported Undo."] = "这些具体对象已绑定到此动作。层级操作不在可撤销范围内。",
		["This call expired or was cleared.\nIts replay draft is still available."] = "该调用已过期或被清除。\n它的重放草稿仍可使用。",
		["This client has no telemetry and no home to call. The only outbound requests it makes are the ones listed here, and every one of them is somewhere you added."] = "本客户端没有遥测，也没有回传服务器。它发出的请求只有下面这些，且每一个都指向你自己添加的服务。",
		["This conversation is no longer available."] = "此对话已不可用。",
		["This conversation is saved again."] = "此对话已恢复保存。",
		["This conversation will not be saved to disk."] = "此对话不会保存到磁盘。",
		["This host"] = "当前宿主",
		["This host cannot compile code, so an internal load is unavailable here. An Infinite Yield you start yourself still works."] = "当前宿主无法编译代码，因此此处不能内部加载。你自己启动的 Infinite Yield 仍可使用。",
		["This host cannot write to the clipboard. You can still paste an export to import it."] = "当前宿主无法写入剪贴板。你仍可粘贴导出的内容来导入。",
