		["This host has no executor HTTP function, so Roblox sends its own User-Agent and drops ours. Everything else still works."] = "当前宿主没有执行器 HTTP 函数，Roblox 会用自己的 User-Agent 并丢弃我们的标识。其他功能不受影响。",
