		["This only binds the draft target. Replace any expired Instance arguments, then review replay separately."] = "这里只绑定草稿的目标。请替换已失效的 Instance 参数，然后单独检查重放。",
		["This pane could not be built: "] = "该设置页无法构建：",
		["This permanently removes every API key and credential saved in this vault from UAI's active configuration. You must choose storage protection and enter your keys again. Your other settings remain. Keys at your providers and existing backups are not revoked or erased. There is no undo."] = "这会从 UAI 的当前配置中永久移除保险库内保存的所有 API 密钥与凭据。你需要重新选择存储保护方式并重新输入密钥。其他设置保持不变。提供商处的密钥与已有备份不会被吊销或抹除。此操作无法撤销。",
		["This proposal is based on an older revision. Review it against the current source."] = "此提案基于旧版本，请对照当前源码检查。",
		["This removes the library draft and its history. Workspace files stay on disk."] = "这会移除库中的草稿及其历史，工作区文件仍保留在磁盘上。",
