		["Tool rounds allowed in one turn, unless the switch below removes it."] = "单个回合允许的工具轮次，除非打开下方开关取消限制。",
		["Tool rounds one subagent may take before it has to answer the parent with what it has. Ignored while Unlimited subagents is on."] = "子代理在必须带着现有结果回应父级之前可用的工具轮次。打开「不限子代理」后此项忽略。",
		["Tool timeout"] = "工具超时",
