		["Undone"] = "已撤销",
		["Undone "] = "已撤销 ",
		["Unfinished mobile native HTTP calls keep ownership across discovery, Stop, new requests and supported client reloads. A separate bounded cancellation lane keeps Stop responsive."] = "未完成的移动端原生 HTTP 调用在发现、停止、新请求与受支持的客户端重载之间保持归属。单独的有限取消通道让「停止」保持响应。",
