		["Update saved action"] = "更新已保存的动作",
		["Updates and help: https://discord.gg/9xYyyYuKap"] = "更新与帮助：https://discord.gg/9xYyyYuKap",
		["Usage"] = "用量",
		["Usage and status"] = "用量与状态",
		["Usage history distinguishes unknown prices from zero-cost work and keeps cache-write usage in cost estimates. Older history retains its known totals without inventing missing prices."] = "用量历史会区分「未知价格」与「零成本」，并把缓存写入计入费用估算。更早的历史保留已知合计，不会凭空补出缺失价格。",
		["Usage is recorded on this device from this update. Requests include retries; estimated tokens are marked."] = "用量自本次更新起在本机记录。请求数包含重试；Token 为估算值时会标注。",
		["Use Humanoid.MoveTo toward a position and wait for arrival. This does not compute an obstacle-avoiding path. Timeout, cancellation and respawn return failure with the observed position."] = "用 Humanoid.MoveTo 走向某个位置并等待到达。不会计算避障路径。超时、取消或重生会以观测到的位置返回失败。",
		["Use Lua pattern"] = "使用 Lua 模式匹配",
		["Use UAI's Roblox tools from Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, OpenCode and other MCP clients through the desktop bridge. HTTP and stdio connections retain normal UAI permissions and isolated tool sessions."] = "通过桌面桥接，在 Claude Code、Codex、Cursor、OpenCode 等 MCP 客户端中使用 UAI 的 Roblox 工具。HTTP 与 stdio 连接保留正常的 UAI 权限与隔离的工具会话。",
		["Use a default"] = "使用默认值",
		["Use a detailed environment guide covering capabilities, permissions, native workflows, shared state and cleanup, with official sUNC references. Stronger main and worker instructions load detailed guidance on demand."] = "使用详尽的环境指南，涵盖能力、权限、原生工作流、共享状态与清理，并附官方 sUNC 参考。更强的主代理与执行代理指令会按需加载详细指南。",
		["Use a rebuilt workspace with Connection, Settings and management screens in modals, clearer assistant responses and improved model and reasoning controls. Context usage shows estimated messages, system/tools, summary and the compaction point."] = "使用重构后的工作区：连接、设置与管理页面以弹窗呈现，助手回复更清晰，模型与推理控制也有改进。上下文用量会显示估算的消息、系统/工具、摘要以及压缩点。",
		["Use at least 12 characters. Several unrelated words make a strong passphrase."] = "至少 12 个字符。几个互不相关的词就能组成强口令。",
		["Use included free access"] = "使用内置免费额度",
		["Use it"] = "使用它",
		["Use native Gemini model discovery, image inputs, tool calls and results, thinking controls and saved signature replay, including OpenCode Go Gemini models."] = "使用原生 Gemini 的模型发现、图片输入、工具调用与结果、思考控制与签名回放，包括 OpenCode Go 的 Gemini 模型。",
		["Use native Gravity Part Control. select/add/deselect require IDs from gravity_parts; clear deselects without releasing overrides. select_all/select_overridden/invert replace the selection, capped at Gravity's native 512 parts. assign/move/ride/physics/release affect the current selection. assign supports pin/manual/shape/normal; a supplied position is shared by all assigned parts. move preserves group offsets and sets manual targets: use position for the group's center or offset for relative movement. physics replaces overrides; {} restores inheritance. release_all clears even unselected overrides. Selection and overrides are live session state."] = "使用原生 Gravity 部件控制。select/add/deselect 需要来自 gravity_parts 的 ID；clear 会取消选中但不释放覆盖项。select_all/select_overridden/invert 会替换整个选择，上限为 Gravity 原生的 512 个部件。assign/move/ride/physics/release 作用于当前选择。assign 支持 pin/manual/shape/normal；提供的 position 会被所有被赋形部件共享。move 保留编组偏移并设置手动目标：用 position 指定编组中心，或用 offset 做相对移动。physics 会替换覆盖项；{} 恢复继承。release_all 会连未选中的覆盖项一起清除。选择与覆盖项都是会话内的实时状态。",
		["Use one key"] = "使用单把密钥",
